42F5F65857FCE4EF00015960F5E77278,0,LIGHTNING SHARK
42F5F65857FCE4F200015961AC56A580,0,When there's a storm at sea the sharks are the first to know...
42F5F65857FCE4FC0001596228E2B8BF,1,HELL IN A SHELL
42F5F65857FCE4FF00015963612FB2C9,0,No turtles were harmed in the making of this high-powered weapon.
42F5F65857FCE505000159644341478B,0,RUMBLE BEE
42F5F65857FCE507000159651F861286,0,Allergic to evil? Want the latest 'buzz' in Rabbid technology? Feel the sting of the Rumble Bee!
42F5F65857FCE50D00015966A3B0195E,0,PIRANHA PELTER
42F5F65857FCE510000159672BF2A8D6,0,What better way to say 'bite me' to your enemies?
42F5F65857FCE515000159683626F1D5,0,BWAH BLASTER
42F5F65857FCE51700015969D50DE6F0,0,"Like Van Gogh, Rabbids often practice their craft with tortured tributes of themselves."
42F5F65857FCE51D0001596AE39C69E2,0,PISTON PANIC
42F5F65857FCE5200001596BF5358087,0,Produce a pulsating progression of powerful projectiles with this pneumatic annihilator!
42F5F65857FCE5240001596C6B5E8EE8,0,CHAW JAW
42F5F65857FCE5260001596D1A106FE2,0,Bat' a thousand with this little beauty!
42F5F65857FCE52B0001596E78E6A399,0,MATTER SPLATTER
42F5F65857FCE52D0001596F2747B794,0,Dispatch your foes with the hot-blooded brilliance and passion of an abstract expressionist.
42F5F65857FCE533000159704F712569,0,BWAHNZAI BILL
42F5F65857FCE5350001597155C80BC4,0,"Our industrious Rabbid friends LOVE Banzai Bill. They think he's cute! This weapon unleashes a power-packed punch, like Bill."
42F5F65857FCE53A00015972184440E7,0,FLAME JOB
42F5F65857FCE53C00015973C0896D01,0,Sleek styling and advanced performance technology in one flame-painted package. You'll be the envy of heroes everywhere!
42F5F65857FCE5400001597432A93BA8,0,TEETH OF TANOOKI
42F5F65857FCE54300015975005EE861,0,"Rabbids love Mario's Tanooki suit so much they made a weapon out of it. Hopefully, they'll return it to his closet before he sees it's gone."
42F5F65857FCE54700015976383FEE04,1,YELLOW SUBMARINE
42F5F65857FCE54900015977420AD76B,0,All your friends are all aboard… WITH KICKING YOUR ENEMY'S BEHINDS!
42F5F65857FCE54D0001597813C024E9,0,BUTTON MASHER
42F5F65857FCE55100015979B1FAB3DC,0,"Unfortunately for enemies, the big red button on this melee weapon won't put an emergency stop to the butt-kicking you're about to dish out."
42F5F65857FCE5560001597AC499F37E,0,BOWSER BASHER
42F5F65857FCE5580001597BECAD83C6,0,"Hey, maybe you'll even get to smack Bowser with his own hands! 'Ow! Why are you hitting yourself? Ow! Why are you hitting yourself?'"
42F5F65857FCE55B0001597CE3B3B9F3,0,SPRING CLEANER
42F5F65857FCE55E0001597DA5B21B36,0,Time to banish those winter blues by decluttering your life of deadbeat derelicts!
42F5F65857FCE5620001597EAF8781EB,0,MIGHTY MITTS 'O MARIO
42F5F65857FCE5650001597F6796B4FB,0,Even Mario could use an extra hand - or two - when it comes to getting a grip on Bowser Jr.'s skullduggery.
42F5F65857FCE57800015980E7878E95,0,TKO
42F5F65857FCE57D00015981FD7B9DBF,0,"When the fight starts, make sure these mitts are in your corner - the all-time heavyweight champ of kicking the bad guys' butts!"
42F5F65857FCE5820001598250CF84CF,0,BEE BLUDGER
42F5F65857FCE584000159834CF63F20,0,High five for the hive! Enemies will BEE wary of getting too close after they feel this beauty's sting.
42F5F65857FCE58800015984AB3EA2BF,0,CONK BUSTER
42F5F65857FCE58B00015985EB1155B7,0,Did you ever have one of those plastic hammers that squeaked every time you bonked your sibling on the head? This is ALMOST as fun.
42F5F65857FCE58F00015986FF7EE219,0,TRACK ATTACK
42F5F65857FCE5910001598753EED71C,0,Time to make tracks… on your opponent's BEHIND!
42F5F65857FCE59500015988813EAEE9,0,BARREL BONKER
42F5F65857FCE598000159898D806181,0,"Barrels were once used to flatten Mario and his friends, now YOU'RE using them to flatten their enemies. Life is funny that way."
42F5F65857FCE59C0001598ABC75B471,0,HYDRANT HAMMER
42F5F65857FCE59F0001598B55BE2277,0,Extinguish your antagonists with this iconic symbol of safety and protection - just don't park within ten feet of it or you'll get a ticket.
42F5F65857FCE5A30001598C36F7AB49,0,TOAD TAPPER
42F5F65857FCE5A50001598D31452B26,0,"A loving tribute to Princess Peach's most loyal attendant, Toad. The poor guy spent hours modeling for the Rabbids who made this."
42F5F65857FCE5AA0001598EDD4E9731,0,BATTLE GAVEL
42F5F65857FCE5AC0001598F0369D86B,0,The bad guys get their day in court and justice ALWAYS prevails when you call for order with this ceremonial symbol of squashing.
42F5F65857FCE5B000015990427AF94B,0,DWARF STAR
42F5F65857FCE5B200015991384A0E2E,0,"Nothing burns hotter than the Dwarf Star, just like nothing burns hotter on the dance floor than Rabbid Luigi at a wedding."
42F5F65857FCE5B60001599204BF7F0A,0,SLAM-HELD
42F5F65857FCE5B800015993F25248CF,0,"Kick butt together anytime, anywhere, with any enemy."
42F5F65857FCE5BE00015994B2D609EB,0,TURBINE
42F5F65857FCE5C10001599593774DEA,0,"Let's pray the Rabbids at Peach's Castle didn't take the parts for this from something important, like a jet engine or hydroelectric dam."
42F5F65857FCE5C500015996093EA401,0,BLASTBERRY SWIRL
42F5F65857FCE5C7000159970FC538B2,0,"Don't be a sucker - sweet victory is yours when you unwrap this long-lasting, flavorful mix of damage and secondary effects."
42F5F65857FCE5CE000159987015FE32,0,BURNING QUESTION
42F5F65857FCE5D100015999D044ED84,0,It's a question that's plagued scientists for ages - how much of a butt whoopin' can your enemies take before it's unfair?
42F5F65857FCE5D50001599A81278900,0,LIFE'S A BEECH
42F5F65857FCE5D70001599B8C2ED678,0,"The Rabbids at Peach's Castle went all out with this one, opting for a classic retro beechwood luxury finish. Looks great around the home!"
42F5F65857FCE5DC0001599CB325F71E,0,GAG ME WITH A SPOON
42F5F65857FCE5DE0001599DFAD861B2,0,Gag your enemies out the door with this primo 'blast from the past'. Available at finer shopping malls everywhere!
42F5F65857FCE5E20001599E1057A6AF,0,EXOSKELETON
42F5F65857FCE5E50001599FE0E4E393,0,The powers of the elements are fused with a Koopa shell and Bowser's favorite jewelry. All the rage at more fashionable battlefields.
42F5F65857FCE5E9000159A0D46D9E10,0,SUGAR RUSH
42F5F65857FCE5EB000159A1CAB9EE40,0,Satisfy your craving for full-flavored firepower with this caustic confection (just don't let it spoil your dinner).
42F5F65857FCE5EF000159A20788547A,0,CROSSHEAD ORB
42F5F65857FCE5F1000159A3F17F586C,0,Put the screws to enemy combatants with this harmful hardware - the ultimate tool in your hero's toolbox.
42F5F65857FCE5F5000159A437BF033B,0,BUTCHER'S BLOCK
42F5F65857FCE5F8000159A5113C6D64,0,Made from 100% lead and BPA-free classic wood building blocks - have fun and learn while kicking your enemy's patootie at the same time!
42F5F65857FCE5FB000159A60CF59E6D,0,TESLA CIRCLE
42F5F65857FCE5FE000159A76BA3E1F3,0,"Nikola Tesla himself would marvel at the Rabbids' handiwork here. Just don't let Thomas Edison get his dirty, thieving hands on it."
42F5F65857FCE602000159A8C42C3424,0,PIPE DREAM
42F5F65857FCE604000159A956A9AEB8,0,"Hopefully, this particular section of Warp Pipe the Rabbids at Peach's Castle 'borrowed' wasn't going anywhere important."
42F5F65857FCE608000159AAA85BDF91,0,POLKA PARTY
42F5F65857FCE60A000159AB7D8DBD2E,0,"Accordion to many experts, the 'Kick Bowser Jr.'s Butt Polka' is a huge hit!"
42F5F65857FCE60E000159ACFEA8B27F,0,BLACK WIDOW
42F5F65857FCE610000159AD460DCE2C,0,"Muscle aches, nausea and paralysis are just a few side effects foes will endure via this weapon - and that's just when you pull it out!"
42F5F65857FCE614000159AE660D35C0,0,SATURN V
42F5F65857FCE617000159AF22FBDC88,0,This rocket represents the latest in 'space exploration' (exploring how much space it takes to blow your enemies into orbit).
42F5F65857FCE61B000159B098CFF6AB,0,STINGER
42F5F65857FCE61D000159B1A8DAAB75,0,"Don't be deceived - while it may LOOK cute, this fuzzy little phenom boasts a bodacious bite."
42F5F65857FCE621000159B2A3FAF823,0,BULLENATOR
42F5F65857FCE623000159B33292D1FD,0,Watch foes sweat 'bullets' on the battlefield when you lock and load this mean-looking munition.
42F5F65857FCE627000159B452FFE2CF,0,THUNDERCEPTOR
42F5F65857FCE629000159B594C9589C,0,"Where there's thunder, there's lightning - where there's the THUNDERCEPTOR, there's a massive butt-kicking!"
42F5F65857FCE62D000159B6C190630C,0,BIG SPIKE
42F5F65857FCE62F000159B7ADDFF781,0,The Rabbids at Peach's Castle were so impressed with these Skewers (they use them as backscratchers) they made several weapons out of them.
42F5F65857FCE633000159B8B47432F6,0,SKY RAIDER
42F5F65857FCE635000159B9CA92A4C6,0,You are cleared for landing… a FIST ON YOUR ENEMY'S FACE!!
42F5F65857FCE64A000159BADD973FC9,0,BIG RED
42F5F65857FCE64E000159BB53A17784,0,Want them to feel a little dread? Just let 'em have a look at ol' Big Red.
42F5F65857FCE654000159BC60CF0E85,0,LOUIS HARMSTRONG
42F5F65857FCE656000159BDF94F5EF9,0,"Sure to strike a foul note with your opponents! I see bruises of green, red noses too…"
42F5F65857FCE65A000159BEDE25A4B2,0,ROCKET FOX
42F5F65857FCE65D000159BFB70B64EB,0,"Sleek, smart and fast - a formidable combination, like a curling team with an aggressive attacking play and an iron-clad defense."
42F5F65857FCE662000159C077C53A27,1,FUCHSIA FURY
42F5F65857FCE664000159C1DC685408,0,"Who says battles have to be boring, drab affairs? This luscious-looking lightgun is not only practical, it's a stylish combat choice."
42F5F65857FCE668000159C2F692696A,1,RED WASP
42F5F65857FCE66A000159C32FA519D5,0,What it lacks in size it makes up for with a powerful payload. Watch enemies scatter or risk getting stung!
42F5F65857FCE66E000159C4EAB37098,0,BARREL BLASTER
42F5F65857FCE671000159C5ED833C06,0,Demolishing your enemies is more fun than a barrel of monkeys with this 'blast from the cask' that smells vaguely of cabbage.
42F5F65857FCE674000159C689600C39,0,DESTRUCTION ZONE
42F5F65857FCE677000159C7118CBBC1,0,There are no detours on the road to victory when this baby clocks in. Watch your enemies' workers' comp claims soar!
42F5F65857FCE67B000159C823725C1D,0,ROYAL PAIN
42F5F65857FCE67D000159C92964408A,0,The Royal Pain lives to remind its inferiors who's really in charge.
42F5F65857FCE680000159CA282984D6,0,LOADED QUESTION
42F5F65857FCE684000159CB030B4712,0,Still trouncing troublemakers with ease? That's a... LOADED QUESTION for you!
42F5F65857FCE689000159CC6C75B038,0,COMET
42F5F65857FCE68B000159CD7E5ACD56,0,Here's an omen for you… you're about to whip your enemies' behinds!
42F5F65857FCE690000159CE2AFCB9C3,0,BRUTE
42F5F65857FCE692000159CF6E616BA1,0,"Enemies get the boot, when you bring out… THE BRUTE!!"
42F5F65857FCE696000159D00E974638,0,RAINBOW RUNNER
42F5F65857FCE698000159D1F83CAB4D,0,Bad guy trouble melts like lemon drops and dreams of butt kickings really do come true over THIS rainbow.
42F5F65857FCE69C000159D2FCE0E46B,0,PAIN SPRAYER
42F5F65857FCE69E000159D32E045230,0,"Portable, easy to clean, and delivers twice the pain in half the time - no air compressor needed!"
42F5F65857FCE6A1000159D4010F568E,0,BIRCHIN' URCHIN
42F5F65857FCE6A4000159D5952A78CC,0,"Much like the spiny, globular animal after which it's named, adversaries will find this beauty tough to handle (or accidentally step on)."
42F5F65857FCE6A7000159D688CB068D,0,NO PITY KITTY
42F5F65857FCE6A9000159D7122761B0,0,"Scratch and claw your way to victory with this graceful, fiercely independent blaster that for some reason gives you sneezing fits."
42F5F65857FCE6B2000159D89A50EC48,0,EXCAVATOR
42F5F65857FCE6B5000159D905BF0C0D,0,Got tunnel vision for victory? This sentry knows the drill so well that winning is in danger of being almost BORING.
42F5F65857FCE6B8000159DA590083EE,0,KEYS TO VICTORY
42F5F65857FCE6BB000159DB1F916267,0,All keyed up? Why not unwind? ON YOUR OPPONENT'S FACE!!
42F5F65857FCE6BE000159DCE0AAA4F9,0,SANDBAGGER
42F5F65857FCE6C1000159DD03876F3C,0,Looks like the Rabbids at Peach's Castle got creative with this one - hope Mario doesn't expect to have his golf clubs back any time soon.
42F5F65857FCE6C5000159DEBF14E7FB,0,LOW BLOW
42F5F65857FCE6C8000159DF9BB1F226,0,Go the full ten rounds with your opponents thanks to LOW BLOW! Spit bucket not included.
42F5F65857FCE6D8000159E08D9A8697,0,HOT ROD
42F5F65857FCE6DA000159E1B32C81E8,0,"Wave the checkered flag and do a lap on your opponent's face before sending them to pit row, permanently."
42F5F65857FCE6DE000159E248926028,0,RAMSEY
42F5F65857FCE6E0000159E395A3DAE1,0,"Next time attackers want to butt heads, just trot this baby out and watch them get all sheepish."
42F5F65857FCE6FC000159E4B7E6DBA9,0,COOKIES N' SCREAM
42F5F65857FCE6FF000159E55774F0D9,0,"I scream, you scream, we ALL scream when treated to this this terrifying swirl of termination!"
42F5F65857FCE703000159E699F15C72,0,ANCHORS AWEIGH
42F5F65857FCE705000159E78DE78703,0,Ride the high seas to victory thanks to this high-damage deployable that WON'T leave you high and dry.
42F5F65857FCE708000159E8DA1992EE,0,GNARLY DAVIDSON
42F5F65857FCE70A000159E97E94DB07,0,"Now the same high-damage deployable favored by outlaws and wealthy, middle-aged dental professionals can be yours!"
42F5F65857FCE70E000159EA5A2619C5,0,BULLSEYE
42F5F65857FCE710000159EBC8287E08,0,"This deployable is anything but flighty! It can't wait to 'dart' into battle, where it always hits its mark."
42F5F65857FCE713000159ECE1480964,0,AVALANCHE
42F5F65857FCE715000159EDAC7B48EB,0,Wanna win by a landslide? Let loose with… THE AVALANCHE!!
42F5F65857FCE719000159EE2F65A3E4,0,DECLOGGER FLOGGER
42F5F65857FCE71B000159EFE4B3B92B,0,"Plunges' into battle, 'flushing' out enemies and 'wiping' them out with ease."
42F5F65857FCE71F000159F0889D4119,0,SUCTION DESTRUCTION
42F5F65857FCE721000159F1EC5C5EBC,0,Enemies whining? Tell them to 'suck it up' until you can CLEAN UP on the field of battle.
42F5F65857FCE725000159F22AEF82E5,0,PRIME MOVER
42F5F65857FCE727000159F3B8F58599,0,Lull in the action? Get things moving again with this space age sharpshooter.
42F5F65857FCE72C000159F46B1BA88B,0,MUFFLER SNUFFLER
42F5F65857FCE72E000159F5E7B0AD9B,0,Cruise your way to victory lane with this mean machine that's surprisingly safe and easy to handle. Also available in sport packages.
42F5F65857FCE732000159F660521C57,0,PHOSPHORUS
42F5F65857FCE734000159F7B5DADCD1,0,"Otherwise known as the 'morning star' - and with this baby on the horizon, it's the dawn of a new day for the bad guys."
42F5F65857FCE737000159F88DCC604F,0,SPIKE STRIKE
42F5F65857FCE73A000159F9D365EA9E,0,"There are going to be some really angry Spikes when all of this is over, but hey - at least their Skewers are being put to good use."
42F5F65857FCE73F000159FA5668C66A,0,BOZO BLASTER
42F5F65857FCE742000159FB3AD31B0C,0,"Reminiscent of the Koopa Clown Car. I wonder how many clowns can fit in that thing? (the Car, not the Bozo Blaster)"
42F5F65857FCE748000159FC15AD1716,0,HOG WILD
42F5F65857FCE74A000159FD6CBD5424,0,Lets you live life high on the hog - assuming you have the chops to wield it. SOO-EY!
42F5F65857FCE74D000159FE17E6E68C,0,HMS LET'S-A-GO
42F5F65857FCE750000159FF7FD47097,0,Set sail for victory when you commandeer this proud-looking precision-class vessel that smells faintly of rotted seaweed.
42F5F65857FCE75300015A008F6E9E65,0,RYU
42F5F65857FCE75500015A011382E9F7,0,"Japanese for 'dragon', this ferocious-looking precision weapon rains fire from above just like its namesake."
42F5F65857FCE75900015A0240309CD6,0,STACKER ATTACKER
42F5F65857FCE75B00015A03B9E975E2,0,"Some poor kid out there is missing their happy stacker rainbow ring toy thanks to this. Hopefully, they have a bumpy ball to play with."
42F5F65857FCE75F00015A049BCE47E7,0,FIREFIGHTER
42F5F65857FCE76100015A055DD8266F,0,Things getting too hot? Time to hose your enemies down with enough firepower to extinguish any hopes they have of victory.
42F5F65857FCE76400015A064D34B954,0,RIVETER
42F5F65857FCE76700015A075919304F,0,Your foes will remain 'riveted' thanks to the power and performance of this best-in-class professional precision tool (warranty extra).
42F5F65857FCE76A00015A08BDF187A7,0,TOP GEAR
42F5F65857FCE76C00015A0965355F88,0,Rumor has it the Rabbids at Peach's Castle took those gears from an old clock tower. Hope that doesn't come back to 'haunt' you.
42F5F65857FCE77000015A0ABBB41B9A,0,Makes even the most grueling battles feel like a day at the beach - don't forget the sunblock!
42F5F65857FCE77400015A0BA680B7EE,0,MASTER CONTROL
42F5F65857FCE77600015A0C0E53E2CD,0,Take control of the battlefield thanks to this menacing-looking sentinel (just keep it away from any mainframe computers). End of line.
42F5F65857FCE77A00015A0DBEE1EC63,0,DRAGONSHIP
42F5F65857FCE77C00015A0E4527A4A3,0,Guaranteed to strike fear in the hearts of foes (as well as anyone from a coastal village in central Europe circa the 8th to 11th centuries.)
42F5F65857FCE78000015A0F0A9FBD87,0,AQUAZOID
42F5F65857FCE78300015A1027D96C96,0,"Whether on land, water, mud or ice, this air-cushioned deployable will stop at nothing to transport trouble to your antagonists."
42F5F65857FCE78800015A1159C1F96B,0,BARN BURNER
42F5F65857FCE78A00015A12946B27F5,0,"Need a hand? This dependable deployable is read to 'pitch in' morning, noon or night."
42F5F65857FCE78F00015A135219E3BD,0,ROAD REAPER
42F5F65857FCE79100015A1405357AA7,0,Put the pedal to the metal and conflict on cruise control with this highway harbinger of pain!
42F5F65857FCE79400015A15847AB4C8,0,DANGER ARRANGER
42F5F65857FCE79600015A16BB5C82AA,0,A clear sign of danger to your enemies. Deploying this sentry means you can 'cone off' your worries and relax!
42F5F65857FCE7B000015A17D187B6BE,0,PAINVILLE EXPRESS
42F5F65857FCE7B200015A18F0F8999E,0,"This 'pain train' delivers a payload of paroxysm to your antagonists, right on schedule."
42F5F65857FCE7C100015A19178B668D,0,ATTACK FROM THE FUTURE
42F5F65857FCE7C500015A1A7D344879,0,Stay light years ahead of your enemy with this latest advancement in sentinel science.
42F5F65857FCE7C800015A1B1DA13450,0,CRATER MAKER
42F5F65857FCE7CB00015A1C4FA67743,0,The hardest working deployable in the business BULLDOZES your adversaries like so much cheap landfill. No overtime necessary.
42F5F65857FCE7CE00015A1DAADB7C3C,0,FATAL FRAME
42F5F65857FCE7D000015A1E98560827,0,Picture this - your enemies getting roasted as they try get past the watchful lens of this deployable. Talk about being photobombed!
42F5F65857FCE7D300015A1FB0C13D02,0,RED LIGHTNING
42F5F65857FCE7D600015A2072DAAAD0,0,Be the storm on the horizon! Victory is yours in a flash when you discharge powerful blasts from this boomshot.
42F5F65857FCE7DA00015A219EDA3236,0,KOINOBORI
42F5F65857FCE7DD00015A2251EEAB23,0,"It's big, mighty and when it comes to taking down opponents, this baby's got teeth."
42F5F65857FCE7E000015A23780287A4,0,PRICKLY PERSUADER
42F5F65857FCE7E200015A2493717EF4,0,Watch enemies lose their 'spines' when you make them feel the heat from this cacti-cannon.
42F5F65857FCE7E600015A25E4E71448,0,PLUMBER'S HELPER
42F5F65857FCE7E900015A26989DE1FF,0,No enemy could be dumber… who seeks to best the plumber.'
42F5F65857FCE7EC00015A27DA5D7EF4,0,MAKI MARAUDER
42F5F65857FCE7EF00015A28DDD73A67,0,"Heads are gonna ROLL when you serve up this spicy serving of boomshot. Check, please!"
42F5F65857FCE7F500015A29917F3AC4,0,BOO STICK
42F5F65857FCE7F700015A2A8A608EE7,0,On the off chance you don't knock the Dickens out of your opponent with this boomshoot you can still scare it out of them.
42F5F65857FCE7FB00015A2BD55AB26B,0,THE SPLATFORMER
42F5F65857FCE7FD00015A2CAAEE5158,0,Send your enemies to Minus World with this groundbreaking boomshot. The End.
42F5F65857FCE80200015A2D60685209,0,LOWRIDER
42F5F65857FCE80400015A2EAD59D3D8,0,How LOW can you GO? (while knocking your opponent's lights out!)
42F5F65857FCE80800015A2FB142CC26,0,WRATH OF THE DRAGON
42F5F65857FCE80A00015A302AE0C148,0,This fire-spewing beast of a boomshot is no myth! Enemies everywhere beware - Here. Be. DRAGONS.
42F5F65857FCE80E00015A3139A0BFDE,0,GROOVE THING
42F5F65857FCE81000015A32BC4BB55D,0,The Rabbids at Peach's Castle made this funky throwback using a collection of 1970's professional rollerdance dresses and some van artwork.
42F5F65857FCE81400015A33135EAB11,0,MUSHROOM MARAUDER
42F5F65857FCE81600015A3478D0A681,0,Power up your performance on the battlefield with this terror-inducing toadstool!
42F5F65857FCE82900015A35C6FD90CF,0,BIG CAT
42F5F65857FCE82B00015A36EE8D0361,0,Your enemies will look like something the cat dragged in after they tangle with this tiger.
42F5F65857FCE82E00015A3771949995,0,BIG BLUE BOPPER
42F5F65857FCE83000015A38122C228D,0,Enemies got you down? Bash the blues away with this bludgeon-type weapon that'll leave 'em black and blue all over.
42F5F65857FCE84100015A390C96C803,0,BONE SHAKER
42F5F65857FCE84300015A3A80871447,0,Shake a leg and get ready for some bone rattlin' fun with this skeletal swatter.
42F5F65857FCE84700015A3BBCF4538F,0,SHELL SHOCKER
42F5F65857FCE84A00015A3CF205668F,0,"Hopefully, you'll have a chance to enjoy the irony of bonking Bowser Jr. on the nose with a weapon inspired by his own likeness."
42F5F65857FCE84F00015A3DB94B10B8,0,MARBLE MASHER
42F5F65857FCE85200015A3E2A4F6BCB,0,Socrates himself would have loved to have this baby at his side during his more heated philosophical arguments.
42F5F65857FCE85500015A3FE323283D,0,SPECIAL DELIVERY
42F5F65857FCE85800015A4089CE2DBE,0,Just have your enemies sign on the dotted line to receive the butt kicking of a lifetime.
42F5F65857FCE85C00015A41B2C500C5,0,THWOMPER STOMPER
42F5F65857FCE85E00015A42A100B439,0,"Enemies best come proper, unless they want to feel the... THWOMPER STOMPER!!"
42F5F65857FCE86100015A439BE1D068,0,BOO BASHER
42F5F65857FCE86300015A44CBB4DE58,0,Hope your foes aren't scared of ghosts… They're about to become one.
42F5F65857FCE86800015A4538D53A97,0,BIG MEAN SUBMARINE
42F5F65857FCE86C00015A46FDE5C81D,0,Plunge your antagonists into the icy waters of defeat when you propel this pummeler across their bow!
42F5F65857FCE86F00015A473CAA16DC,0,RABIES RATTLER
42F5F65857FCE87300015A48E7C866EA,0,Don't go to bat against your foes with anything less than this winged war hammer of the night.
42F5F65857FCE87800015A498803E00F,0,DEADBOLT
42F5F65857FCE87B00015A4ABB4CB455,0,No one gets past this powerful melee weapon once it springs to action. Victory is a lock!
42F5F65857FCE88700015A4B793E4E2D,0,CLOBBER CHOMPER
42F5F65857FCE88900015A4CC065B57A,0,You'd think after making this the Rabbids at Peach's Castle would avoid Chain Chomps at all costs - turns out Rabbids love the little rascals!
42F5F65857FCE88C00015A4D72F57A43,0,FEEL THE HEAT
42F5F65857FCE88F00015A4EF23AFE49,0,Give 'em a little 'oven lovin' with this recipe for for butt-kicking: 1) Preheat to 200 degrees Celsius. 2) LIGHTLY grease. 3) Conk on head!
42F5F65857FCE89200015A4FEE82D485,0,BLUE FLAME
42F5F65857FCE89400015A50ADA215B5,0,"A powerful weapon that'll cook your opponent's goose, getting the job 'well done' every time."
42F5F65857FCE89800015A5101BE2DE7,0,CROWN JEWEL
42F5F65857FCE89B00015A52716B64E8,0,Those who defy the crown get a quick serving of courtly justice - right upside the head!
42F5F65857FCE89E00015A53D48514AA,0,ROYAL RABBID
42F5F65857FCE8A100015A54CDF5F122,0,"The Rabbids at Peach's Castle LOVE Princess Peach so much, they made this weapon so that she'd always feel close to them. Lucky her."
42F5F65857FCE8A500015A5556490C8E,0,BLOCK BLASTER
42F5F65857FCE8A700015A564B8BCBA2,0,"No mystery here - just aim, pull the trigger and 'block out' any hopes enemies have of winning the battle."
42F5F65857FCE8AB00015A57D77593BA,0,BARRACUDA
42F5F65857FCE8AD00015A58DAC21BB3,0,"Sleek, fast and ferocious. When this boomshot surfaces, the bad guys get schooled, big-time."
42F5F65857FCE8B100015A591DE91E68,0,RAZZLE DAZZLE
42F5F65857FCE8B300015A5ABCDF7A91,0,Wanna add some oomph to the action? Spice to the scuffle? Sashay to the fray? Then get ready to dazzle the competition with this beauty.
42F5F65857FCE8B800015A5BDF8507FD,0,LAVANATOR
42F5F65857FCE8BB00015A5CFC8358F1,0,As dangerous as it is majestic - hits with the force of a super volcano. Time to kick a little 'ash'!
42F5F65857FCE8BF00015A5D6064EA55,0,KANAGAWA POWA
42F5F65857FCE8C200015A5ECD441F0E,0,Surf's up… and evil's about to take a gnarly wipeout as this top class wave hits the battlefield.
42F5F65857FCE8C500015A5FBE842102,0,NASTY YELLA FELLA
42F5F65857FCE8C800015A609DE27C40,0,"Rest assured, it's your foes that will turn yellow when you introduced them to your 'little friend'."
42F5F65857FCE8D600015A614717C6D2,0,BATTLIN' BILL
42F5F65857FCE8D900015A6275E88C35,0,"The love affair between Banzai Bill and the Rabbid inventors continues. Hopefully, he won't sue."
42F5F65857FCE8E300015A6305271F2C,0,BIG TOP
42F5F65857FCE8E500015A642575AAE7,0,"Everyone loves a clown, but when THIS harlequin heater takes the center ring, no one will be laughing."
42F5F65857FCE8EA00015A65FEE24D76,0,SMACKEREL
42F5F65857FCE8ED00015A6653239548,0,The catch of the day - 1.9 kilograms of delicious enemy butt kicking!
42F5F65857FCE8F000015A671CD78FDF,0,THE DUCKESS
42F5F65857FCE8F300015A68D050FA0B,0,Enemies to the crown should give this grenaduck a wide berth - lest they get royally hosed.
42F5F65857FCE8F700015A696B24C56F,0,SILENT BUT DEADLY
42F5F65857FCE8F900015A6A46541ACB,0,"Smells like… VICTORY? (Please, someone! Open a window!)"
42F5F65857FCE8FD00015A6BBA3CC96D,0,BWAHMMO!
42F5F65857FCE90000015A6C88C1BCD7,0,Bwahmbs away! Rabbids take to explosions like a duck to water.
42F5F65857FCE90500015A6D75A313B6,0,BRÜNNEHILDE
42F5F65857FCE90700015A6E2EE76ACA,0,Bring down the final curtain for your opponents with an explosive aria from this combative contralto.
42F5F65857FCE90B00015A6F3F90496B,0,VON QUACKINGTON
42F5F65857FCE90D00015A70AD5B57EF,0,'Listen to them. Children of the night. What music *bwah* makes.' - Baron Von Quackington
42F5F65857FCE91200015A71709A7A20,0,FIREQUACKER
42F5F65857FCE91400015A72D610C259,0,"When the fat hits the fire, send out an emergency call to this grenaduck and get out of its way. Film at 11!"
42F5F65857FCE91800015A73016259EA,0,KAMEK PANIC
42F5F65857FCE91A00015A742DD34FF6,0,"Stranger things have happened in the Mushroom Kingdom! Actually, no - this is probably the strangest."
42F5F65857FCE91D00015A7568CC9E3B,0,GOBBLEGOOSE
42F5F65857FCE92000015A76886A368E,0,Guaranteed to cure your enemy's bellyaching in a hurry.
42F5F65857FCE92500015A777169F532,0,THE KING
42F5F65857FCE92800015A788BC1E89A,0,"Nothing burns hotter than the King, and as it turns out, nothing explodes like him either."
42F5F65857FCE92B00015A79997012C7,0,COCK-A-DOODLE-KABOOM
42F5F65857FCE92D00015A7AA8D3D955,0,Awake at the crack of dawn to the bucolic sounds of this robust rooster loudly proclaiming its territory with an ear-piercing explosion.
42F5F65857FCE93100015A7BA3E6D24B,0,SCUBAM!
42F5F65857FCE93300015A7C52B1747E,0,"Stands for Self-Contained Underwater Bomb Attack Mallard. Invented by the famous Rabbid explorer, Bwahcques Bwahsteau."
42F5F65857FCE93800015A7DD45CB47D,0,SPITFIRE
42F5F65857FCE93B00015A7EEA262036,0,"Give the enemy a taste of your thunder or go down in flames with this dashing, brave grenaduck."
42F5F65857FCE93F00015A7FA1D470B3,0,EGG FRY
42F5F65857FCE94100015A8015E9493C,0,Don't be left with egg on your face - tell your foes to 'beat it' with this rapid-fire rumblebang!
42F5F65857FCE94500015A8145ADD6D7,0,BULLDOG
42F5F65857FCE94800015A8216637C38,0,Throw your enemies a bone by making their demise short and sweet.
42F5F65857FCE94B00015A839020D83A,0,PIRANHA PERSUADER
42F5F65857FCE94E00015A843E568435,0,The Rabbids at Peach's Castle often take breaks to play Sharks and Minnows with a Piranha Plant acting as the shark.
42F5F65857FCE95300015A857532DAB3,0,MEGA BITE
42F5F65857FCE95500015A8671A7B0A4,0,"Unlike SOME people, you don't need to wear a mask to show everyone how tough you are, not when you add this bite to the fight."
42F5F65857FCE95900015A87E785DA5B,0,RENEGADE
42F5F65857FCE95C00015A88BACC3FB0,0,"Has only one function - to derezz your enemies. Now, finish the game!"
42F5F65857FCE95F00015A89D3F4CD3A,0,ATTACK O' LANTERN
42F5F65857FCE96200015A8AB5EA4BFA,0,Want to 'carve up' the competition? Light them up with this festive fiend.
42F5F65857FCE96700015A8B3B17762D,0,BIG FINISH
42F5F65857FCE96900015A8CBB7A39EB,0,The soundtrack to your enemy's destruction! It's the final countdown (to their doom!)
42F5F65857FCE96D00015A8DFDB02FC4,0,PALADIN PULVERIZER
42F5F65857FCE96F00015A8E5FEE185C,0,A beacon of virtuous butt kicking!
42F5F65857FCE97300015A8F76E08DBF,0,CHOMPER STOPPER
42F5F65857FCE97500015A9027E152BB,0,Rabbids at Peach's Castle LOVE to play keep-away from Chain Chomps. They also use them to protect home base during Capture the Flag.
42F5F65857FCE97900015A91EDB4B5F7,0,BOLTY
42F5F65857FCE97B00015A922AE25E81,0,The nuts and bolts of victory begin with mastery over the mechanics of this finely constructed weapon.
42F5F65857FCE98000015A936483592A,0,BRUTAL NOODLE
42F5F65857FCE98300015A94292CF52D,0,Victory never tasted so good!
42F5F65857FCE98600015A951A5C1042,0,KIMONO NO NO
42F5F65857FCE98900015A968CC25038,0,The only thing cooler than a breeze rippling through your casual summer kimono is saying 'sayonara' to your enemies.
42F5F65857FCE98C00015A975C1BEFB6,0,YOSHIMITE
42F5F65857FCE98F00015A981B7444E2,0,The only thing cuter than this little Yoshi-inspired duckling is when it blows your enemies to the hereafter!
42F5F65857FCE99600015A9963EB330C,0,SAM KINGFISHER
42F5F65857FCE99800015A9A975B354F,0,This secret spec ops agent has seen A LOT - some it would rather forget… Like canned tuna as a pizza topping.
42F5F65857FCE99C00015A9BCBFD5CE1,0,DISCO DUCK
42F5F65857FCE99E00015A9C15B2E032,0,Guess who'll be 'stayin' alive' when this superfreak of a grenaduck hits the dance floor?
42F5F65857FCE9A100015A9DB582247E,0,BOZO BOOM
42F5F65857FCE9A400015A9E89D28427,0,The greatest show on Earth? Smackin' your enemies upside the dome.
42F5F65857FCE9A900015A9FC119B879,0,SIR CRACKERS
42F5F65857FCE9AB00015AA0AF32A6A6,0,The noble knight Sir Crackers has taken an solemn oath to kick your enemies' patooties.
42F5F65857FCE9AF00015AA1D0874F90,0,MALLARDARIO
42F5F65857FCE9B100015AA23A65E478,0,A high-damage duck whose diet consists of mushrooms and gold coins.
42F5F65857FCE9B700015AA3338AF836,0,ANNIHILATION FROM ABOVE
42F5F65857FCE9BA00015AA42F46B338,0,"Light 'em up from on high with this highly trained, strategically mobile mallard."
42F5F65857FCE9BE00015AA5C80477B9,0,BOWSERBEAK
42F5F65857FCE9C100015AA69424FD1A,0,As mean and nasty as the villianous Koopa King it was inspired by. Now it's YOUR turn to breathe a little fire!
42F5F65857FCE9C600015AA722A68735,0,LOONIGI
42F5F65857FCE9C900015AA8CBC747EC,0,"The grenaduck version of this popular hero sends enemies running for the hills, rather than the other way around."
42F5F65857FCE9CD00015AA9845F228D,0,PINWHEEL
42F5F65857FCE9EF00015AAACA06B395,0,Don't let its whimsical hat fool you. This grenaduck is all business when it pedals onto the battlefield.
42F5F65857FCE9F300015AABFD666D52,0,BOWSERTAIL JR.
42F5F65857FCE9F500015AACFDD0CF94,0,"A direct descendent of the Bowsertail, albeit more impulsive and with a higher pitched jumping sound."
42F5F65857FCE9FA00015AAD62CBF2A9,0,QUACKIMOTO
42F5F65857FCE9FC00015AAE34EE9D04,0,"The esteemed Quackimoto is a general, military strategist, philosopher and exploding rubber duck."
42F5F65857FCE9FF00015AAF6BCA1D86,0,EGG CREAMER
42F5F65857FCEA0200015AB03CEBED6A,0,Cream your enemies with this high-cholesterol cackleberry!
42F5F65857FCEA0600015AB1903E70E2,0,LAST DANCE
42F5F65857FCEA0800015AB2F922243B,0,Party's over - time for your enemies to 'hustle' out the door. 'Hot stuff's' comin' through!
42F5F65857FCEA0B00015AB354308941,0,BWAHRMAGEDDON
42F5F65857FCEA0D00015AB4689AB78B,0,The final bwahckoning is here. Are your enemies prepared?
42F5F65857FCEA1000015AB527AE55E0,0,SURLY TEMPLE
42F5F65857FCEA1400015AB68EA2513F,0,"Start with spite for your enemies, add a splash of vengeance and garnish with some ill will and you've got a sweetheart of a weapon."
42F5F65857FCEA1800015AB70479F18C,0,KABUKI COMMANDO
42F5F65857FCEA1A00015AB85A3F939E,0,No need to MASK your anger with your foes when you take the stage with this precursor to pop culture - it makes crushing foes drama-free.
42F5F65857FCEA1E00015AB961AA7E20,0,RAINBOW ROASTER
42F5F65857FCEA2100015ABAB045B1C5,0,"Don't be fooled by this mighty meteorological marvel's beauty, the only color spectrum your enemies will see is black through blue."
42F5F65857FCEA2500015ABBF895F0FF,0,EYE OF THE KRAKEN
42F5F65857FCEA2700015ABC4C3C0D4A,0,"Far beneath the murky sea, the Kraken sleeps where sunlight flees, until fire of combat lights its wick, it rises for foe's butts to kick."
42F5F65857FCEA3100015ABD43E5C0BA,0,CALAVERA CANNON
42F5F65857FCEA3300015ABE1425217E,0,"While most sugar skulls are edible, this one is not. Seriously, don't lick it - it gets really hot after it's been in use."
42F5F65857FCEA3700015ABFB3DB48A4,0,CROSSFIRE CASTLE
42F5F65857FCEA3A00015AC02DAC7717,0,"TOWER above the competition, then send their hopes for victory to the deepest, darkest pit of your dungeon and throw away the key."
42F5F65857FCEA3D00015AC135108128,0,LUAU LAUNCHER
42F5F65857FCEA3F00015AC2CA979C5E,0,Have your antagonists ride the waves… to their DOOM!
42F5F65857FCEA4300015AC313363B3E,0,PREY OF KITSUNE
42F5F65857FCEA4500015AC496D040C8,0,Wanna outfox your foes? Summon the power of this foxy lady to the battlefield and watch them turn tail and flee.
42F5F65857FCEA4C00015AC594207689,0,ORIGAMI
42F5F65857FCEA4E00015AC66461562B,0,Enemies will fold like an accordion when they see you've mastered the art of kicking butt with this resplendent rumblebang.
42F5F65857FCEA5100015AC7F36A47BA,0,SUPA BWAHZOOKA
42F5F65857FCEA5500015AC873CD6485,0,"The inventors behind this rocket managed to distill the destructive energies of 1,000 Rabbids into a single, concentrated weapon."
42F5F65857FCEA5900015AC97482F5DE,0,BRUSH WITH MORTALITY
42F5F65857FCEA5B00015ACAC5E9CC35,0,Your enemies will 'bristle' after you give them the brush off with this rigger-rocket (be sure to clean it with paint thinner when finished).
42F5F65857FCEA5F00015ACB64CB1183,0,SONG OF KONG
42F5F65857FCEA6100015ACC483E1F53,0,An aPEALing option when foes are tone deaf to your cries for victory. This baby's roar will get them singing a different tune in no time.
42F5F65857FCEA6500015ACDA8F80A52,0,CANDY STRIPER SNIPER
42F5F65857FCEA6800015ACE9F84CF1C,0,"Packs a powerful peppermint punch that leaves foes defeated, disoriented but with a delightful minty aftertaste."
42F5F65857FCEA6B00015ACF15DB1828,0,TORPEDO
42F5F65857FCEA6E00015AD0FCD1A744,0,"It's full speed ahead to the victory when you man (or woman) the torpedo - watch your enemies dive, dive, dive! (for cover)."
42F5F65857FCEA7100015AD1BD754EDC,0,EAT LEAD
42F5F65857FCEA7400015AD25225ABAA,0,This sharp-looking rocket really drives your point home with your foes (also good for doing math homework).
42F5F65857FCEA7A00015AD3D4182273,0,FIRST RESPONDER
42F5F65857FCEA7D00015AD4161A8C53,0,"For those brave few whose instincts have them running TOWARDS danger, instead of away from it."
42F5F65857FCEA8100015AD59DA76835,0,PASTEL FAREWELL
42F5F65857FCEA8300015AD6BE5C08E7,0,A pigment-powered rocket also capable of making really cool drawings of pirate ships (or ninjas).
42F5F65857FCEA8800015AD783F0E531,0,BLOOPER SHOOTER
42F5F65857FCEA8A00015AD81021D8CB,0,"From the deepest, darkest pits of the ocean rises this calamari cannon to unleash its wrath upon your foes."
42F5F65857FCEA8E00015AD99AAACD35,0,TIMBER!
42F5F65857FCEA9000015ADA1B1B75A7,0,"Walk softly and carry a big stick, for the bigger they are, the harder they fall."
42F5F65857FCEA9500015ADBDE05DEDA,0,SIXTY-WATT SWAT
42F5F65857FCEA9700015ADC4DBD354B,0,Here's a 'bright idea' - help your enemies see the light with a sixty watt butt whoopin'!
42F5F65857FCEA9B00015ADD68F9F9DA,0,BOOM RACCOON
42F5F65857FCEA9E00015ADE89CDBAD9,0,"There's no masking it - when it's not busy crawling through your garbage cans, this ring-tailed rocket is wiping its hands of your enemies."
