CF956F195809D6DB0000032ADBCA002D,1,"{0}

{1}
{2}
{3}"
CF956F19580A1D0D000003F724178C9B,0,"STOMP JUMP an enemy to cause damage, then leap to the safety of an empty cell - all while exercising your glutes."
CF956F19580A1DDA00000413D47AAC59,0,Enjoy jumping but dislike deciding where to land? Relax - DOUBLE JUMP allows up to TWO team jumps in a single move. Impress your friends!
CF956F19580A23E30000050410BEC9BA,0,"You may have only begun your training, but the results are encouraging. You've already reached level 2 weapon mastery!"
CF956F19580A24150000050D58C488B6,0,You trained hard and your weapon mastery has been raised to level 3! You'll deal more damage with any weapon.
CF956F19580A241800000513953BE8BD,0,"You've just reached weapon mastery level 4! No matter which weapon you wield, you'll do more damage."
CF956F19580A241A000005194B13FC1D,0,Now you're playing with power! You maxed out the power gauge! You are now a true master at arms!
CF956F19580A25DC000005BFF4F23CE5,0,"In the Power Dojo you can spend the Power Coins to increase the Heroes' Weapon Mastery.
It's just outside Peach's Castle, but you can access it even on the go!"
CF956F19580A25F8000005CEFEDD830F,0,"Hey, you! Quit hogging all the fun! Head to the Buddydome near Peach's Castle to show off yours skills with another player!"
CF956F19580A260F000005D70EC25911,0,amiibo R&D is where Rabbids experiment with those lovely figurines. Do you have any of them? Bring them to the new facility - it's near Peach's Castle.
CF956F19580A2624000005E0BB5C48B3,0,"You can now use the signature Rabbid transport to go back in time and replay Chapters you already completed.
Improve your performance and win lots of golden trophies!"
CF956F19580A298F0000034D9DBB8D5A,0,"Just point him to the battlefield! (the back of it, that is). Be sure to check Luigi's Skill Tree too!"
CF956F19580A29BF000003563F6E073A,0,"Wind him up, set him loose and get out of his way! Go and check Rabbid Mario's Skill Tree to have him fit for a fight."
CF956F19580A29D7000003600CB87D58,0,"She's kind, she's determined, she's ready to fight. Hail to the Princess! Customize her regally by accessing her Skill Tree."
CF956F19580A29EE0000036943848FF9,0,"Half Rabbid, half Yoshi, ALL menace! Open his Skill Tree and get him ready to rumble!"
CF956F19580A2A0F00000373CD1BC180,0,Saddle up! Yoshi's on the war path! Boost him via Skill Tree to face the challenges to come!
CF956F19580A3A150000043FC05B8D82,0,{0} CHALLENGES
CF956F19580A3A7C0000045542961DDF,0,"Explore {0} from scratch and find all the 10 Rabbid Challengers!<br>
Complete Challenges to gain more
Power Orbs!"
CF956F19580A3EED000003D7567699BB,0,"Welcome to the Power Dojo! Here you can spend Power Coins to increase the weapon mastery of a Teammate of your choice.
The more Power Coins you spend, the more you fill the Power Gauge, unlocking new levels of mastery!"
CF956F19580A3FFE000003DF5DA5E23E,0,"In the Battle HQ you can manage your lineup and customize your arsenal. Check those weapons with Super Effects: they can alter enemy behavior. Burn, freeze, ink and more!"
CF956F19580A4021000003EA71471409,0,"Welcome to the Museum! Here you can collect and admire all that stuff you find while cleaning up the Mushroom Kingdom. Artworks, 3D Models, Soundtracks and more! Unleash the completist within you!"
