6C76C9565810E75E0000033415548BA8,0,"Normally the Rabbids' Washing Machine would be able to take you anywhere you wanted throughout space and time. Thanks to the Megabug however, its powers are limited, and it can only take you back in time to your arrival in the Mushroom Kingdom.
Here's the good news - you can replay all the chapters of the game and go hunting for Gold trophies while you're at it. Just remember - you will be able to use only the contextual actions unlocked at that time."
6C76C95658123CA30000032A0BA6FD24,0,The amiibo R&D is where Rabbids experiment with those lovely figurines. Do you have any of them? Bring them here!
