CF956F195825B0B40000056560F148B9,0,Choose which Heroes to bring with you into battle! Don't be afraid to experiment - they all have something unique to offer.
CF956F195825B0F60000057E20E91ECA,1,Each team features Mario and at least one Rabbid to ensure maximum team chemistry.
CF956F195825B1440000059171B42640,1,"You can preview a hero's unique strengths and abilities by opening the INFORMATION TAB using the <gameaction src=""MenuButtonX""> Button."
CF956F195825B15F0000059CAD848D8E,0,Placeholder. DO NOT USE!
CF956F195825B176000005A7F63C4127,0,Placeholder. DO NOT USE!
CF956F195825B1B6000005B2248E89DF,0,Placeholder. DO NOT USE!
CF956F195825C7CA000001AE9D5CBE9D,0,Use this tab to equip your Heroes with a primary weapon. Weapons have the following specializations:
CF956F195825C836000001BA4E950E7C,0,Damage
CF956F195825C89D000001C7B5CFBC0B,0,Super Effect
CF956F195825C8C2000001D0B15CC58B,0,Bonus to Hero's abilities.
CF956F195825C8DB000001D95209E8BA,0,"You can preview a weapon's stats by opening the INFORMATION TAB using the <gameaction src=""MenuButtonX""> Button."
CF956F195825C949000001E24B858A90,0,"If you unlock Secondary Weapons for a Hero, you can check them by pressing <gameaction src=""MenuButtonY"">."
CF956F195825D69B000002C5B5E64AAF,0,Placeholder DO NOT USE
CF956F195825D6C3000002CEF3652DD3,0,Placeholder DO NOT USE
CF956F195825D95D0000031747EECC2C,0,"This amazing Rabbid invention allows you to <font preset=""Ubi Game Text Bold 40"">replay previous Chapters</font> so you can earn more <font preset=""Ubi Game Text Bold 40"">Gold trophies</font>. Also, you can play <font preset=""Ubi Game Text Bold 40"">all-new Challenges</font> for more <font preset=""Ubi Game Text Bold 40"">Power Orbs</font> and <font preset=""Ubi Game Text Bold 40"">Coins</font>!"
CF956F195825D9B300000326F95D1E3A,0,Be aware that when replaying a Chapter you are limited to the contextual actions that were available to you the first time you played through it.
CF956F195825DA6A0000034282A4D66B,0,The good news is that you can keep the rest of your new powers so you can REALLY go for the Gold!
CF956F195825DCD5000003946ECA5E03,0,The Museum is here to preserve your cherished memories forever. On display is everything you've collected during your adventures. Talk about a high achiever!
