2D92BCDA58A19C380000000B7CB15E73,0,REACH AREA
D6AA725758A47353000112AC551F7E8E,1,Want the latest 'buzz' in Rabbid technology? Feel the sting of the Rumble Bee!
D6AA725758A4734E000112AB0419401C,1,This ferocious-looking weapon rains fire from above just like its namesake.
D6AA725758A4734A000112AACE10376A,1,"When this boomshot surfaces, the bad guys get schooled, big-time."
D6AA725758A47346000112A9A82E09D4,1,A beacon of virtuous butt kicking!
D6AA725758A47341000112A8B41CA978,1,What better way to say 'bite me' to your enemies?
D6AA725758A4733C000112A791EB6519,1,Let's pray the Rabbids didn't take the parts for this from something important.
D6AA725758A47337000112A657C633C8,2,Demolishing your enemies is more fun than a barrel of monkeys!
D6AA725758A4732F000112A5452B20B7,1,"Hey, maybe you'll even get to smack Bowser with his own hands! 'Ow! Why are you hitting yourself? Ow! Why are you hitting yourself?'"
D6AA725758A47362000112AD8DA7BD50,2,There are going to be some really angry Spikes when all of this is over.
D6AA725758A4736A000112AEC24360E9,1,Makes even the most grueling battles feel like a day at the beach.
D6AA725758A47379000112AF0C94C11D,1,Rabbids love Mario's Tanooki suit so much they made a weapon out of it.
D6AA725758A47384000112B0A2D1250F,2,"Sweet victory is yours when you unwrap this long-lasting, flavorful mix of damage and secondary effects."
D6AA725758A47398000112B2CBB12FBC,1,"Where there's thunder, there's lightning - where there's the THUNDERCEPTOR..."
D6AA725758A473AD000112B44A552B9C,1,Just have your enemies sign on the dotted line to receive the butt kicking of a lifetime.
D6AA725758A473C6000112B6788E825C,2,Put the screws to enemy combatants with this harmful hardware!
D6AA725758A473DD000112B8C6A1A03E,2,Extinguish your antagonists with this iconic symbol of safety and protection!
D6AA725758A473FA000112B9F8AC757B,1,The greatest show on Earth? Smackin' your enemies upside the dome.
D6AA725758A47416000112BBD3778FC0,1,Power up your performance on the battlefield with this terror-inducing toadstool!
D6AA725758A4742D000112BDEE33A7CB,2,When it comes to this melee weapon it's an eye for an eye… with an eye!
D6AA725758A47AEA00011F7FDC6B1E20,0,GOLDEN BULLET
D6AA725758A47AEA00011F80BCE24C4D,0,"This shiny, 24 karat cannoneer is the gold standard when it comes to striking it rich on the battlefield (or filling cavities)."
D6AA725758A4802E00011F85221F35F2,0,WAR PAINT
D6AA725758A4802E00011F86D83C3C32,0,"Paint your enemy into a corner, then flush them down the tubes with this acrylic assassin!"
D6AA725758A4804700011F8B047932B9,0,SPIDER IGNITOR
D6AA725758A4804700011F8C0C7E816A,0,"Watch as your foes struggle, only to become further entangled in your intricately woven web of butt whipping!"
D6AA725758A4805900011F910F7177E4,0,SONS OF BWAHNARCHY
D6AA725758A4805900011F92352566B4,0,"This road-ripping lightgun is as quick, dependable and smooth as the street bobbers it was inspired by."
D6AA725758A4807500011F97B1EACE3E,0,FLANNEL PHENOM
D6AA725758A4807500011F98D4FC0CB6,0,"Don't get mad, get PLAID - as in this plaid persuader that will CHECK victory off your list, every time."
D6AA725758A4808A00011F9DDCD51D7A,0,CERAMIC PANIC
D6AA725758A4808A00011F9E88F3E911,0,When this is all over let's hope this vase can go back to holding something nice like roses or one of those fresh fruit bouquets.
D6AA725758A480DE00011FA3141F1F62,0,VISCERA VAPORIZER
D6AA725758A480DE00011FA4C476FB13,0,Early Egyptians used canopic jars to store the organs of the dearly departed (let's all hope the one used to make this weapon was empty).
D6AA725758A48A3E0001244242C30EF9,0,THORN SCORN
D6AA725758A48A3E0001244357695D41,0,Be a thorn in your enemy's side with this menacing specimen taken straight from Spooky Trails (just don't sit on it by accident).
D6AA725758A48A59000124485B51A45A,0,FAT CAT
D6AA725758A48A5900012449B0240587,0,Enemy got nine lives? Let the cat out of the bag and get ready to grin like a kitty with a bowl of cream.
D6AA725758A48A640001244E8356E7EF,0,GRUDGE METAL
D6AA725758A48A640001244FD14842C4,0,"No enemy is strong enough to stand up to the angst-filled, introspective apathy of this lugubrious lightgun."
D6AA725758A48A6E0001245424ED8A99,0,CARPE DIE-EM
D6AA725758A48A6E00012455AD1998E5,0,"This ornamental lightgun symbolizes love, friendship and crushing your enemies faster than a pond full of carp can eat a watermelon."
D6AA725758A48A780001245A40CFA43E,0,ANVIL
D6AA725758A48A780001245BE87BEC0D,0,Turn up the heat and bring the hammer down - it's time to 'melt down' some miscreants!
D6AA725758A48AAA00012466DA85C3A6,0,HAMMER TIME
D6AA725758A48AAA00012467C21BFDE5,0,"The law of the golden hammer says 'If all you have is a hammer, everything looks like a nail' (or in this case, like a foe to squash)."
D6AA725758A48AB40001246C4CAB76A9,0,SUCKER PUNCHER
D6AA725758A48AB40001246DE87CFF65,0,It's a unanimous verdict… your enemies suck!
D6AA725758A48ABD00012472A6126773,0,PEEPER REAPER
D6AA725758A48ABD0001247376E6EE2C,0,Talk about hard on the eyes! When it comes to this melee weapon it's an eye for an eye… with an eye!
D6AA725758A48AC7000124785A77A2CA,0,GLAMOR HAMMER
D6AA725758A48AC7000124790A4A085C,0,"There's only one thing better than smashing your way to victory, and that's looking fabulous while you do it."
D6AA725758A48AD10001247E736C1B2B,0,GRID GAVEL
D6AA725758A48AD10001247FF8E35C40,0,"Greetings, programs! We hope this futuristic flail serves you well in the fight against sinister hacker programs… Er, I mean, Bowser Jr."
D6AA725758A48ADD00012484BC5458E8,0,TOXIC TRUNCHEON
D6AA725758A48ADD00012485A2978D70,0,"Don't let things mushroom out of control on the battlefield - this poisonous pole hammer leaves a bad taste in your foe's mouth, every time."
D6AA725758A48AE80001248A47392E23,0,SUNSET SLAMMER
D6AA725758A48AE80001248B0BC3E627,0,"Kick back, relax and watch your worries (and your opponents) dip below the horizon with this twilight tormentor."
D6AA725758A48B0F00012496ED81C818,0,SHINING DAWN
D6AA725758A48B0F000124973B53484E,0,Earn yourself a gold star for destruction when you transmute this malleable elemental from passive inventory item to a battlefield beauty.
D6AA725758A48B4D0001249C3F85279C,0,CORRUPTER
D6AA725758A48B4D0001249D6741FB88,0,"In the fight for the users, the only way to win is to survive."
D6AA725758A48B5C000124A2B20D2E3F,0,ROUND SHIELD SHOCKER
D6AA725758A48B5C000124A3AE67E56D,0,Nail your enemies right in the Gokstad thanks to this elemental weapon. Awesome Viking beard not included.
D6AA725758A48B68000124A82FB529C6,0,GEMCUTTER
D6AA725758A48B68000124A9DA20CECB,0,"Want to hear something outrageous? Truly, truly, TRULY outrageous? Your foes think they can avoid a vicious butt-kicking by this elemental."
D6AA725758A48B72000124AE5515E6C4,0,CACTUS FRACAS
D6AA725758A48B72000124AF3F2A4C10,0,Feeling 'needled' by your antagonists? Just bring this high antioxidant elemental to bloom on the battlefield - damage drought over!
D6AA725758A48B7C000124B48E75A457,0,CROSSHAIR NIGHTMARE
D6AA725758A48B7C000124B567CEBCF8,0,Stay 'dialed in' on victory with this optic elemental that nearly always hits its mark (ghillie suit not included).
D6AA725758A48B86000124BA9CA0BFD6,0,CIRCLE OF STRIFE
D6AA725758A48B86000124BBA06ADC3C,0,"Whether the cool energy of the moon or the warm energy of the sun, the vibe of this weapon is anything but soothing for your foes."
D6AA725758A48B96000124C0D1DDD745,0,MARBLE MARAUDER
D6AA725758A48B96000124C1BDE2088B,0,You'll be playing for 'keepsies' when you knuckle down with this agate elemental!
D6AA725758A48BF9000124C847F480F7,0,GOLDEN ROCKET
D6AA725758A48BF9000124C983822797,0,Elevate your opponent's destruction beyond the mundane with 24 karat gold premium explosions that overcome the senses with luxury (and pain).
D6AA725758A48C05000124CE52959085,0,MIGHT OF THE KITE
D6AA725758A48C05000124CFEB48C1A1,0,The Rabbids had to 'pull some strings' to make this rocket - be careful not to tangle it in some power lines or scare nesting birds with it.
D6AA725758A48C10000124D4DB5F87BC,0,CORSAIR
D6AA725758A48C10000124D5749BC45F,0,"Woe to anyone unlucky enough to be under the flight path of this ferocious dogfighter! Now, go lay some eggs, soldier!"
D6AA725758A48C1C000124DA5A918619,0,AGRO TORPEDO
D6AA725758A48C1C000124DB3ACDCD4C,0,"Blow off some steam with this rocket that's all the 'rage' amongst hotheads, malcontents and lone wolves with an axe to grind."
D6AA725758A48C26000124E09ED00913,0,WORLD CANNON
D6AA725758A48C26000124E15EEB610B,0,"Desperate for materials, Rabbids used a world cannon for this rocket. Too bad - as it was your only chance to see Providence, Rhode Island."
D6AA725758A48C31000124E6BF40BB1B,0,JADE JAGUAR
D6AA725758A48C31000124E7E59FB2F8,0,Enemies need to keep an eye on their blind spot or else they'll fall to the stalk-and-ambush style of this opportunistic apex predator.
D6AA725758A48C42000124EC50E99FC4,0,RIGHTEOUS ROCKET
D6AA725758A48C42000124ED3AB61C22,0,"The blobs on this rocket like, move and stuff - it's like, they grow, break up, fall down and start all over - like the cycle of life, man."
D6AA725758A48C6C000124F296F9EA54,0,BLING MACHINE
D6AA725758A48C6C000124F31A2E08E2,0,A nugget of wisdom - don't get between Rabbid Peach and her favorite auric accessory unless you want to be ground to gold dust.
D6AA725758A48C79000124F811BC9203,0,ELECTRON
D6AA725758A48C79000124F9D36AA87E,0,Once this baby gets charged up it's the END OF THE LINE for your enemies!
D6AA725758A48C81000124FE995FF955,0,BALLISTIC MYSTIC
D6AA725758A48C81000124FF9EF2739F,0,"The wizard hat used to make this was originally bought at a souvenir stand at an amusement park in New Jersey - still, it's pretty magical."
D6AA725758A48C8C00012504EEC1973E,0,PAY THE PIPER
D6AA725758A48C8C000125057C19862C,0,Crush your enemy's pipe dream of defeating you in combat!
D6AA725758A48CA60001250A67B93295,0,NEW WAVE WRECKER
D6AA725758A48CA60001250B21FA83CC,0,"Get ready to make waves with this androgynous-looking lightgun that not only defeats your enemies, but single-handedly put an end to disco."
D6AA725758A48CB10001251074F3F572,0,CAMOUFLAGE CORSAGE
D6AA725758A48CB10001251156FD4739,0,Want to make a grand entrance? You'll be the 'belle of the battlefield' when you debut this covert camo cannon.
D6AA725758A48CBA00012516DE939371,0,RUN FOR THE HILLS
D6AA725758A48CBA0001251779057D6E,0,The hills are alive… with the sound of your enemy's suffering!
D6AA725758A48CC70001251C32E584A1,0,LUCKY DEVIL
D6AA725758A48CC70001251DC1833EA1,0,Having a devil of a time defeating your enemies? They'll have ZERO luck overcoming this nasty little lightgun. Yes… ZERO luck.
D6AA725758A48CEB000125229E15883A,0,BUCK
D6AA725758A48CEB000125234D09CF0C,0,Lock horns with the enemy in style when Buck takes the battlefield! Made with 10% copper to reduce the chances of scratches and dents.
D6AA725758A48CFD0001252831BA1294,0,ALARM CLOCK
D6AA725758A48CFD00012529C98F2C96,0,Rumor has it the Rabbids took these parts from an old clock tower in Spooky Trails. Hope that doesn't come back to 'haunt' you.
D6AA725758A48D080001252EEA1A05AE,0,IRON CURTAIN
D6AA725758A48D080001252FF3A39DDB,0,If you want to keep the bad guys in check you need to strike while the iron is hot! Wise-cracking computerized A.I. not included.
D6AA725758A48D160001253496C95F72,0,HEART ATTACK
D6AA725758A48D1600012535BD6E7A4B,0,There's no love lost when this darling deployable races onto the scene - love is a battlefield!
D6AA725758A48D220001253A40455B7A,0,CAMO WHAMMO
D6AA725758A48D220001253BA8540F4B,0,"The latest in deployable sentry weapon system platform is ready for inspection, sir! Now, drop and give me twenty (enemy butt kickings)!"
D6AA725758A577C30000033BF96CD899,0,GOLDEN TOUCH
D6AA725758A577C30000033CC4CF4807,0,"Unlike King Midas, you can't turn foes into gold, however you CAN turn them into sniveling crybabies with this gold-plated precision weapon."
D6AA725758A577D000000341B6A20191,0,BAGSNIPER
D6AA725758A577D000000342BEC07AE1,0,Shut yer opponent's geggie then blow 'em a funeral dirge with this plaid precision pipe.
D6AA725758A577DA000003471953E1D9,0,LUIGI'S LONGSHOT
D6AA725758A577DA0000034835AD484B,0,"This outfit actually belongs to a Luigi Garibaldi of Milford, Delaware (he just happens to have the same fashion sense as you-know-who)."
D6AA725758A577E40000034DA1C50978,0,UP CLOSE & PERSONAL
D6AA725758A577E40000034E1A616449,0,Be the first to make contact - with your enemy's face!
D6AA725758A577F2000003535B3104C0,0,HARVEY BRAWLBANGER
D6AA725758A577F200000354EAB551AE,0,Long day on the battlefield? Get ready to kick back and 'mix it up' by serving your enemy a stiff one - a stiff boot to the rear!
D6AA725758A5780200000359C704C6E9,0,LIL' TIKES LOAD N' GO
D6AA725758A578020000035A013FFED5,0,Just because you're in the thick of battle doesn't mean you can't have fun. Laugh and learn with the latest in precision weaponry for kids.
D6AA725758A5780C0000035F869C1F19,0,FIREBREATHER
D6AA725758A5780C0000036087A6AD22,0,"Dragons are thought to guard great treasure hordes, though today most have their gold invested in real estate trusts and mutual funds."
D6AA725758A57816000003656704BCD7,0,DENIM DESTROYER
D6AA725758A5781600000366DDEEC3EC,0,In a tight spot? With this baby in your back pocket you'll wrangle the bad guys in no time with only minor chafing around the crotch area.
D6AA725758A5782C0000036B0A454373,0,GOLD RUSH
D6AA725758A5782C0000036C64E16E29,0,"There's gold in them hills, so get ready to stake your claim - on your opponent's face!"
D6AA725758A5783E000003718B8F510C,0,KILLER EXTINCT
D6AA725758A5783E0000037226C96C03,0,"Get 'Jurassic' in gear and get ready for the ride of a lifetime with a deployable so advanced, it defies evolution. The park. Is. OPEN."
D6AA725758A5784E00000377DD1C2E28,0,ATTACK FROM THE FUTURE II
D6AA725758A5784E00000378204DF148,0,"It's back! It's back from the future and believe me, it looks VERY gloomy for you enemies."
D6AA725758A578600000037DFCE80386,0,BWAHNTASAURUS WRECKS
D6AA725758A578600000037EF642EDC7,0,"Possible influences here include the dinosaurs, the Bwachness Monster or the Creature from the Bwahk Lagoon."
D6AA725758A5786B000003830CD1FEE2,0,DISORIENT EXPRESS
D6AA725758A5786B00000384C6C9A364,0,"Simply have your enemies step aboard to experience a truly timeless, opulent butt-kicking refined to an elegant art (champagne extra)."
D6AA725758A5787500000389974B3207,0,DEPLOY TOY
D6AA725758A578750000038AF85D4E46,0,"Don't get all wound up - just send this colorful, carefully-carved classic onto the battlefield to pop your opponent's bubble."
D6AA725758A578990000038F069BAC2E,0,GOLDFISH
D6AA725758A5789900000390B3F5D419,0,"Weird how goldfish sound really valuable but they actually cost like, 29 cents at the pet store."
D6AA725758A578A800000395126788FE,0,KITE COMMANDO
D6AA725758A578A8000003962D819991,0,Knock the wind out of their sails with this powerful parafoil that provides hours of fun at the beach or your local kite festival.
D6AA725758A578B30000039BF86E1376,0,SUNFLOWER POWER
D6AA725758A578B30000039CFE5B48B3,0,Don't get salty with your enemies - just whip out this symbol of summer and let it spit!
D6AA725758A578BF000003A1E1DBA622,0,MATRIX MASHUP
D6AA725758A578BF000003A238C941DF,0,"Which will it be? The red pill or blue? There's also yellow… and green. Wait, there's orange, too! Shoot - never mind, these are chocolates."
D6AA725758A578D9000003A778456029,0,COLUMN CRUSHER
D6AA725758A578D9000003A888A26231,0,Strike gold with this 'bionic ionic' and hope your enemies appreciate the craftsmanship and artistry that's gone into sealing their doom.
D6AA725758A578E4000003ADF6B25B1E,0,BAT OUT OF HECK
D6AA725758A578E4000003AEFF9CC7FA,0,"Knock your enemies into next week without batting an eye - one last, final kiss!"
D6AA725758A578F4000003B3A3444FF3,0,COPPER BOPPER
D6AA725758A578F4000003B48EF8541A,0,Enemies would be NUTS to stand against you while you wield this (also makes for a good hollandaise pot during peacetime).
D6AA725758A57923000003B9A38DC750,0,THUNDERBOLT
D6AA725758A57923000003BABA7E3106,0,"Smite your enemies with the mighty, mountain-crushing hammer of Norse legend (flight not included with this model)."
D6AA725758A5793C000003BF344D8D90,0,BULLION BILL
D6AA725758A5793C000003C05BFAB41F,0,Unleash a 24 karat cannonade at your foes with this gilded grump that gives new meaning to the word 'payload'.
D6AA725758A57946000003C5E9125B9C,0,HEAVY ARTIL-LILY
D6AA725758A57946000003C6272AAEA7,0,Unleashes a powerful volley of fragrant fusillades at your lily-livered opponents!
D6AA725758A57952000003CB7590DE15,0,ZEBRA MUSCLE
D6AA725758A57952000003CC56402569,0,The unique stripe pattern of zebras make them the most recognizable animal ever - it also makes for really cool bed sheets and baggy pants.
