D6AA725758A5C0A00000137DBFFDC6C8,1,Sleek styling and advanced performance technology in one flame-painted package.
D6AA725758A711DB0000001BCDEBC59B,0,The Ancient Gardens at Peach's Castle - gotta jump through some hoops to find it!
D6AA725758A711E20000001FE3A0A74D,0,That patch of Sherbet Desert near Peach's Castle - does it RING a bell?
D6AA725758A7121500000023580820D5,0,"The Spooky Trails section of Peach's Castle - it RINGS alarm bells, doesn't it?"
D6AA725758A7121B00000027D9A90416,0,The Lava Pit region of Peach's Castle is just two HOOPS and a holler from here.
D6AA725758A712230000002B83632A2D,0,The Rabbids hid this SOMEWHERE in the Ancient Gardens - WHERE is anyone's guess.
D6AA725758A7123400000030A04E2261,0,Rabbids hid it for you somewhere in the Sherbet Desert - but they forget where.
D6AA725758A7123A00000034D1D30DF4,0,The Rabbids were too scared to recall where in Spooky Trails they stashed this.
D6AA725758A7124400000038080675F3,0,Could be anywhere in the Lava Pit (the Rabbids were in a hurry to get out).
D6AA725758A7124A0000003CAF9F25DD,0,You'll have to fight for this one - midway through the Ancient Gardens.
D6AA725758A712510000004008A90D41,0,You'll have to 'ride out the storm' midway through the Sherbet Desert for this one.
D6AA725758A712590000004425C93A4A,0,"WELL, WELL! You've a fight on your hands - halfway through Spooky Trails."
D6AA725758A7126000000048D2578D8D,0,MECHanically speaking - this one (midway through the Lava Pits) won't be easy.
D6AA725758A712650000004C1AA607A6,0,You'll need to go ape to unlock this one at the end of the Ancient Gardens.
D6AA725758A7126B00000050289E77CC,0,You'll have to break the ice to unlock this one at the end of Sherbet Desert.
D6AA725758A7127100000054E15E1A93,0,Enjoy an evening of opera to unlock this at the Spooky Trails' dramatic climax.
D6AA725758A7127A000000593008B267,0,"Sorry, cannot display this info string because of a Megabug."
D6AA725758A7127F0000005DB466FF9B,0,Ancient Gardens - once you learn a few new MOVES you can bridge the gap here.
D6AA725758A712860000006170506904,0,Sherbet Desert - your spirits will get a big LIFT when you find this secret area.
D6AA725758A7128C00000065679C9910,0,Spooky Trails - finding this swampy secret area will be a SMASH.
D6AA725758A712910000006961A3DFF0,0,"Lava Pit - let's be CRYSTAL clear, finding this hidden cave won't be easy."
D6AA725758A712960000006DC1F13CA7,0,Only the miniature likeness of the bravest of plumbers can unlock this number.
D6AA725758A712A000000071FAF89DCD,0,The moment is ripe for a miniature princess to unlock this weapon.
D6AA725758A712AE00000078E48A3F31,0,It's no TALL order for a plumber (or his likeness anyhow) to unlock this one.
D6AA725758A712B70000007B706515A0,0,The miniature friend that unlocks this weapon is DINO-mite!
D6AA725758A712BD0000007FD8C9CDC7,0,"Once your work is done, then you'll have some ULTIMATE FUN!"
