D6AA725758B81E7A0000DB794C62CF5C,2,CUSTOM EXCLUSIVE
D6AA725758B81E7A0000DB7A00E4F04B,1,This custom exclusive makes a smart trade - LOTS of Super Effect damage in exchange for most regular damage.
D6AA725758B81E7A0000DB7BB0582620,2,One Blow
D6AA725758B7FA590000448CAA49C078,0,Go big or go home! (or both… when you deliver a WICKED blow to your enemy at cost to your health).
D6AA725758B7F8EE0000448922E6BD1D,1,You've got to give a little - but you'll get a lot with this vampiric vaporizer!
D6AA725758B7FB13000044928A852CB7,0,Who NEEDS to deal damage when you're bleeding your foe of THIS much health to add to your own?
D6AA725758B7FE1700007014DCF54B52,1,CUSTOM EXCLUSIVE
D6AA725758B7FE1700007015859036EA,0,Rattle your foe's cage with this earth shaker rump-breaker in exchange for some paltry weapon damage.
D6AA725758B7FE170000701621B6109D,1,Shake n' Quake
D6AA725758B81331000089A41E9400F6,1,CUSTOM EXCLUSIVE
D6AA725758B81331000089A54F9AB617,0,"Gives a HUGE bonus to sentry damage at the low, low cost of doing zero dash damage. You need Sentries from the Skill Tree!"
