CF956F1958C7D80800001349C26DA12B,0,"Now, before combat begins, you can choose whether to leap headlong into the heat of battle like a rage-filled animal…"
CF956F1958C7D84F0000135316013693,0,"…or take time to carefully plan your strategy first, like some of the great fighting tacticians of history!"
CF956F1958C7D8730000135B86F86319,0,This reticule belongs to the TactiCam. Focus it on a particular Hero to see all kinds of information about them.
CF956F1958C7D8920000136355BCCE37,0,"Using <gameaction src=""TacticalViewGoToNextPreviewArea""> and <gameaction src=""TacticalViewGoToPreviousPreviewArea"">, you can cycle through a Hero's range of attack for each weapon (red) and their range of movement (blue)."
CF956F1958C7D8A90000136B659733CF,0,The TactiCam is perfect for enemy reconnaissance! Focus it on a foe to see all their dirty little secrets!
CF956F1958C7D8C0000013732AC2F052,0,"For any combatant, <gameaction src=""TacticalViewLockPreviewArea""> keeps their range of attack or movement locked so you can move them around and see what's in range."
CF956F1958C7D8E70000137DD1AD47F4,0,"At any time, you can teleport back to Battle HQ for some last minute adjustments or charge straight into the fray!"
CF956F1958C7D8E90000138360232932,0,"You can even use the TactiCam DURING a battle! Remember, the key to victory is preparation. Good luck!"
CF956F1958C7FF870000DAAE65E8FD0C,0,You can check each Hero's details by clicking the INFO button.
CF956F1958C7FFD50000DAC0CA8C6AEE,0,Here you can select weapons to give each hero.
CF956F1958C7FFEE0000DAC86847440D,0,All weapon stats are in this section:
CF956F1958C800090000DAD03250DA39,0,The weapon's secondary stats.
CF956F1958C8000C0000DAD67BB8B9FD,0,You can see details about each weapon by checking the INFO section.
