CF956F1958CBF142000002A63CA3135A,0,You don't have enough Power Orbs!
D6AA725758CC02D600001076F269A5D5,0,GOLDEN GOOSE
D6AA725758CC02D6000010774A418B0B,0,This gold version of the standard grenaduck includes a season pass subscription (to future butt kickings)!
D6AA725758CC02C900001070FDA2DC3E,0,BULLION BLASTER
D6AA725758CC02C900001071FE317C40,0,"While your enemies might not appreciate the superior craftsmanship, you'll love the creativity, art and attention to 24 karat butt-kicking detail."
D6AA725758CC02B90000106A9519C0BA,0,SIR GOLDWAIN
D6AA725758CC02B90000106B76C4C8F4,0,"Bling Arthur's most loyal grenaduck is fiercely devoted to your cause. Known for being kind and gallant, right up to the point of exploding."
D6AA725758CC17820000123DA14E5738,0,GOLDEN RULE
D6AA725758CC178A0000123E1A4432C6,0,"He who has the gold, makes the rules - but he who has the POWERGUN, makes those who have the gold make the rules - get it?"
D6AA725758CC02860000105EC60DD371,0,GOLDEN TONGUE
D6AA725758CC02860000105FA5EAD6ED,0,"The materials used to make this rocket were beyond value. I speak of course of the gold coins. Er… I guess there was a Rabbid involved, too."
CF956F1958CFDC3D000002790FFCD72E,0,"Welcome to the Skill Tree, where you can spend Power Orbs to upgrade your Heroes!"
CF956F1958CFDC630000028B8E896192,0,"Each hero has a unique skill set and upgrades available to them. Highlight a hero and press <gameaction src=""MenuConfirm""> to get started."
CF956F1958CFDC81000002946145B691,0,Each hero has four categories of skills and upgrades.
CF956F1958CFDC8F0000029D9E113ED9,0,Movement
CF956F1958CFDC91000002A3113E56E5,0,Attack
CF956F1958CFDC96000002A9FB7AF8E0,0,Technique
CF956F1958CFDC98000002AFBB98BB03,0,Other
CF956F1958CFDC99000002B5965E6B7C,0,"To unlock a particular skill path, you must first unlock the prerequisite skills that precede it."
CF956F1958CFDC9B000002BB57FA141B,0,"The Other group is available only once all the moves, offensive abilities and feats for a hero have been unlocked."
CF956F1958CFDC9E000002C173068FB6,0,"If you change your mind about which skills or upgrades you want to buy, press <gameaction src=""MenuButtonX""> to undo."
CF956F1958CFDCA3000002C70FE65CC6,0,"Lazy? In a hurry? Press <gameaction src=""MenuButtonY""> to upgrade your hero automatically."
CF956F1958D0F04100000232251CEBCD,1,PRESS {0} TO START
