CF956F1958D3E02900000345B79E726D,0,GOLD WEAPONS
CF956F1958D3E02C0000034C08EF0B94,0,Shiny Gold Weapons are awaiting you at the Battle HQ!
D6AA725758D3EA51000015004E7C82AF,0,1-UPPER DISRUPTER
D6AA725758D3EA4E000014FF7C401BAF,0,Rabbids have an uncanny ability to find 1-Up Mushrooms no matter how well hidden… they're just too lazy to be bothered normally.
CF956F1958D641C00000F6B55C41F358,0,REMOVE
CF956F1958D643CB0000FBF5B51517ED,0,???
788FDFAE58DA225600000758C8DCFA5C,0,BUDDYDOME
788FDFAE58DA27120000077E608C1BB4,0,"Welcome, to another edition of… BUDDYDOME!"
788FDFAE58DA272F00000785A1BA3EFE,0,"In the Buddydome, you and a friend each control a team of two Heroes…"
788FDFAE58DA273F0000078B836EA0F3,0,…that will work TOGETHER to complete a campaign involving lots of challenges! (Hint: you can unlock campaigns by finishing a world in story mode).
788FDFAE58DA276E00000793ABA785BE,0,All the skills and weapons you've unlocked in story mode will be available to you – visit Battle HQ to get your team ready!
CF956F1958DA34E70001C00541698ED8,0,In cooperative - or co-op mode - you and another player will take turns acting against a common enemy.
CF956F1958DA351E0001C018261F2004,0,"If you take your turn first, you can stop at any time and hand things over to your teammate by pressing {0}."
CF956F1958DA35320001C021D4619AA6,0,If your teammate is first - you can ask them at any time to end their turn so you can start yours by pressing {0}.
CF956F1958DA354F0001C02A22574115,0,"During your turn, you can force the enemy to start theirs by holding down {0} for several seconds."
CF956F1958D289D1000002913C58FA3C,0,NEW CO-OP CHALLENGE UNLOCKED!!
CF956F1958D28C83000002B20B7A2FD6,0,HARD MODE UNLOCKED!!
CF956F1958D28DB4000002C75FBCD576,0,"Congratulations!

You have unlocked a new Co-op Challenge for this Campaign!"
CF956F1958D29D420001B288AE165778,0,{0} HARD MODE
CF956F1958D29D8D0001B293B29069B9,0,"Congratulations!

You can now play all {0} Co-op Challenges in Hard Mode!"
E07AA88658C98F080000027FA65C0F5D,0,An easier level of challenge.
E07AA88658C98F1F000003F885BE703F,0,The intended level of challenge.
E07AA88658C98F38000003FF0FD25FE1,0,HARD MODE
E07AA88658C9903F00000412D826B3A4,0,"Hard mode.
Complete the Campaign once in any difficulty to unlock."
E07AA88658C99889000006070BE1DA95,0,HARD
E07AA88658C998BA0000061424B39E2F,0,NORMAL
E07AA88658C998CD0000061F1A7659AE,0,EASY
E07AA88658C99B6A0000067D2F457D92,0,UNLOCK
E07AA88658D3A356000007A82FC1682D,0,TEAM 1
E07AA88658D3A38F000007B3524246F7,0,TEAM 2
E07AA88658D3AB2000000808DDD4E938,0,{0} - {1}
E07AA88658D91B9F000007A56C52FF6D,0,READY
42F5F65858DD0DE20000DE13327BC887,0,FLUSHED WITH VICTORY
42F5F65858DD0DE20000DE14749B7F4A,0,"Though there's strength in numbers, in the end each team must plunge ahead to their own safe zone to ensure victory. Hint: Pipes can be used as cover!"
42F5F65858DD0E0F0000DE1914368D2B,0,REMEMBER THE BWAHLAMO
42F5F65858DD0E0F0000DE1A45DDB6FE,0,"Two teams, two paths that lead to the fort where hostile forces are garrisoned, awaiting your arrival. VICTORY OR DEATH! (or at least, a nasty defeat)"
42F5F65858DD0E240000DE1FC2A87A37,0,BANANA BEACH
42F5F65858DD0E240000DE20119BB0A5,0,"Covert combustible cover points stand between each team and their finish lines. Hint: After reaching the first zone, you may go back to help your friends."
42F5F65858DD0E610000DE25C44CB050,0,HORROR FROM ON HIGH
42F5F65858DD0E610000DE266B2DCE8A,0,A deadly race to reach higher ground while your foe tries to obliterate you from overhead. Hint: React - then counter with long range or area attacks.
42F5F65858DD05D30000DDBD73B8786A,0,GARDEN PARTY… OF DOOM!
42F5F65858DD05D70000DDBE490AD5D9,0,Don’t be fooled by the sunny skies and rolling greens - the corrupted Rabbids have regrouped since you were here last. Time to pull out the weeds.
42F5F65858DD136300000009912C73ED,0,ARE YOU NOT ENTERTAINED?
42F5F65858DD13630000000A5E3A9D5F,0,Defeat a given number of enemies to prove your mettle on the arena of combat. Hint: use heights to your advantage.
42F5F65858DD13AE000000159338A7B5,0,FLOTILLA THRILLA
42F5F65858DD13AE000000168B059850,0,Escort the oft-separated pals Toad and Toadette to safety. Hint: Invulnerable cover points are either a boon or a bane depending how you use them.
42F5F65858DD13BB0000001B3446DFCF,0,FOUR LEAF COVER
42F5F65858DD13BB0000001C7886C738,0,The road to victory is strewn with a chosen number of enemies you must defeat! Hint: Four quadrants here have four different cover types.
42F5F65858DD13E30000002181A254DE,0,KING OF THE RING
42F5F65858DD13E30000002298FB6B88,0,SOMEONE wants a rematch - think you can survive in the squared circle versus one of the Mushroom Kingdom's most heinous heels? Hint: It's go time!
42F5F65858DD13910000000F6281C6C2,0,ERUPTION CORRUPTION!
42F5F65858DD1391000000104DE7A349,0,"Deep in the bowels of Bowser Jr.’s volcano, corrupted Rabbids still toil away at their depraved drudgery. Time to hand out some pink slips."
42F5F65858DD106D0000DE4316AAF644,0,REVENGE OF TUTANBWAAAHMON
42F5F65858DD106D0000DE44621DFD85,0,Eons of Rabbid history are at risk from looters! Hint: use area attacks (like rockets) to score a victory for Rabbid historians everywhere.
42F5F65858DD10880000DE49FE05D296,0,RABBIDS INVASION
42F5F65858DD10880000DE4AC59F1C0D,0,Teams must cross their individual finish lines despite an onslaught of Rabbids on a field filled with surprises. Hint: You won't like the surprises.
42F5F65858DD10A10000DE4FB72DE196,0,BULLET HILL
42F5F65858DD10A10000DE50D31527DE,0,They say it's lonely at the top - but you'll have plenty of competition for high ground on Bullet Hill. Hint: Use deployables to watch your back.
42F5F65858DD10B80000DE558C8CE37E,0,BLOW HOT N' COLD
42F5F65858DD10B80000DE5603B3BBD8,0,"Brave the elements - literally, along with combustible cover points to survive a stormy situation. Hint: Deployables know which way the wind blows."
42F5F65858DD0FBE0000DE3DF7106A4B,0,JUST DESERTS…
42F5F65858DD0FBE0000DE3E68719277,0,"In a desolate corner of a desperate wasteland, corrupted Rabbids still rule – can you slog through the difficult terrain to send them slithering?"
42F5F65858DD11070000DE61C9CBE998,0,ABBEY IN THE ABYSS
42F5F65858DD11070000DE625A7214F5,0,Send a special visitor packing to win - IF you can reach him. Hint: Watch for hidden cover points. Area of effect attacks are your friends.
42F5F65858DD11860000DE6766550A86,0,THORNY SITUATION
42F5F65858DD11860000DE68605A3BF1,0,This is no garden variety encounter - squash a given number of enemies to win. Hint: Cover points can be demolished - some have lots of side effects.
42F5F65858DD11990000DE6D8B934FF2,0,SWAMP ROMP
42F5F65858DD11990000DE6E81903D46,0,Drain the swamp of bad guys - just don't get bogged down while reaching your respective safe zones. Hint: Boil stagnant water before drinking.
42F5F65858DD11B20000DE7310C1E09C,0,CITADEL ON THE HILL
42F5F65858DD11B20000DE74A569C38E,0,Escort Toad and Toadette to safety - hint: it'll be an uphill climb (with lots of explosive cover points).
42F5F65858DD10E60000DE5BC7300E4E,0,UNHAPPY TRAILS TO YOU…
42F5F65858DD10E60000DE5C1E6DF556,0,"Corrupted Rabbids haunt this place, still. Can you exorcise their restless spirits? Or will they continue to torment Spooky Trails forever?"
42F5F65858DD0F7F0000DE31203DABF3,0,BASIC TRAINING
42F5F65858DD0F7F0000DE329D55B47E,0,Get back to basics while you clear the battlefield of ALL enemies. Hint: Target the enemies behind covert cover points to neutralize them.
42F5F65858DD0F9B0000DE37FA316C47,0,CALL ME WHEN YOU GET THERE
42F5F65858DD0F9B0000DE382664D314,0,Each team must safely reach their respective finish lines to secure a group victory. Hint: Use long-distance weapons to take out far away foes.
42F5F65858DD0EA80000DE2B6ECB7190,0,MEGABUG RIDE
42F5F65858DD0EA80000DE2C9FF102A0,0,Under the shadow of the Megabug you’ll show what you’ve learned so far – and get ready for the ferocious co-op campaigns to come.
D6AA725758DD31BD00000012AEF51541,0,"<font preset=""Ubi Game Text Regular 1-39"" >Immunity to Super Effects</font>"
D6AA725758DD31D2000000158417F4B7,0,"<font preset=""Ubi Game Text Regular 1-39"" >Global DMG reduction</font>"
D6AA725758DE221A00001BABAD24E985,1,"Like van Gogh, Rabbids often practice their craft with tortured tributes of themselves."
CF956F1958DE67DC0000E90C75079C5A,0,Are you sure you want to quit the Washing Machine replay? Any unsaved progress will be lost.
D6AA725758DE8C57000017A257E46D21,1,"The Rabbids at Peach's Castle LOVE Princess Peach so much, they made this weapon so that she'd always feel close to them. Lucky her."
CF956F1958E0F4AA000007F65E1127E2,0,ON
CF956F1958E0F4AD000007FCFC70FE8E,0,VIBRATION FEATURE
CF956F1958E0F4AF00000802FA4F9744,0,OFF
CF956F1958E0D426000002C7FA9587D2,0,Are you sure you want to reset all your Skills?
CF956F1958E0D456000002CF7E663B1C,0,Are you sure you want to automatically fill your Skill Tree?
E07AA88658E24D7D000007C4F84E72F6,0,Best Performance
CF956F1958DCE3C5000003B75E7268EC,0,EASY
CF956F1958E2697500000761FF6CF676,0,REQUIRES
CF956F1958E26D70000002BFEE231BD3,0,"This skill is locked - you need to unlock the prerequisite skills that support it, first."
CF956F1958E275BD0001C145D1CAB556,0,RETURN TO BUDDYDOME
CF956F1958E3992F0001373C6AFE93B0,0,Do you want to return to the Buddydome?
AE72C3FD58E3AA1E0001001BAA3F202A,0,x {0}
D6AA725758E49FE40001388EDD55795C,2,Lets you live life high on the hog - assuming you have the chops to wield it. SOO-EY!
D6AA725758E4A0380001388FDC488DD0,2,"Has only one function - to derezz your enemies. Now, finish the game!"
D6AA725758E4A0B7000138918D03122E,2,Allergic to evil? Want the latest 'buzz' in Rabbid technology? Feel the sting of the Rumble Bee!
D6AA725758E49EF10001388A87C113FC,3,Bad guy trouble melts like lemon drops and dreams of butt kickings really do come true over THIS rainbow.
D6AA725758E4A0AD00013890DC6D5A33,2,"Our industrious Rabbid friends LOVE Banzai Bill. They think he's cute! This weapon unleashes a power-packed punch, like Bill."
D6AA725758E49F7A0001388D3C832B44,1,"Enemies get the boot, when you bring out… THE BRUTE!!"
D6AA725758E4A1AC000138935AF5AC7E,3,Watch enemies lose their 'spines' when you make them feel the heat from this cacti-cannon.
D6AA725758E4A0D500013892083E810E,2,Be a thorn in your enemy's side with this menacing specimen taken straight from Spooky Trails (just don't sit on it by accident).
D6AA725758E49F710001388C18AB27B5,2,Scratch and claw your way to victory with this graceful blaster that for some reason gives you sneezing fits.
D6AA725758E4A2DB00013894FC9EE8E1,2,Bring down the final curtain for your opponents with an explosive aria from this combative contralto.
D6AA725758E49F680001388BA873BCB9,2,The wizard hat used to make this was originally bought at a souvenir stand at an amusement park in New Jersey.
D6AA725758E4A2ED0001389531422376,2,"Nothing burns hotter than the King, and as it turns out, nothing explodes like him either."
D6AA725758E4A30100013896F9C9BD9B,2,Guaranteed to cure your enemy's bellyaching in a hurry.
D6AA725758E4A3370001389775E99767,2,"From the deepest, darkest pits of the ocean rises this calamari cannon to unleash its wrath upon your foes."
