CF956F1958E614FC000002D5DF2958A5,0,"Congrats! You just unlocked the SKILL TREE - now you can upgrade your Heroes!

Also, by defeating that Pirabbid Plant you earned Power Orbs, which are exactly what you need to purchase things from the Skill Tree! Coincidence? HARDLY!

Let's go now to Battle HQ so you can spend your well-earned Power Orbs!"
