CF956F19595501600001041D039C0EDC,0,Credits
CF956F195955016F0001042527037AE5,0,Quit
CF956F195955017F0001042DDC43903A,0,I wanted to thank you for saving Arthur...
CF956F195955018D0001043595FB4E3A,0,My eyes have started to get used to the dark!
CF956F19595501A5000104430A50852B,0,Aircraft is the most polluting and energy-consuming means of transport. It is better to take the train if you can.
CF956F19595501B20001044BD03E54CD,0,"You've never tried it? It's a thirst-quenching drink made from plants... If only someone knew the recipe, I'm sure all the plants you need to make it grow in the taiga!"
D6AA72575956122100000015D3BCA979,0,Dummy Weapon DLC
D6AA725759561221000000164497E35E,0,Dummy Weapon DLC description
D6AA72575948EC3700000014500D5116,0,ASCII ERADICATOR
D6AA72575948EC3700000015CCDA7410,0,"Thanks to ASCII you can call your enemy ""068 079 082 075"" without getting grounded."
D6AA72575948ED920000001EA98B4C5F,0,RETRO DEFLATOR
D6AA72575948ED920000001FD69FD0F3,0,"Retro chic fashion is making a comeback, and so are YOU when you accessorize with this popular pulsating 'power glove'."
D6AA72575948EEB40000002822DEE391,0,BOOM BROOM
D6AA72575948EEB400000029524BA243,0,"Lightweight and collapsible for easy storage, this long-range rattler is a menace to faraway foes and pet hair alike!"
D6AA72575949157100001AD98DD2C1FB,0,CARTRIDGE COMMANDER
D6AA72575949157100001ADA55F5E2CB,0,Although we haven't seen these misfire yet you should blow any dust off it before shooting (just don't lick it).
D6AA72575948F31F00000036A97E9D7C,0,BAIT N' SWITCH BRUISER
D6AA72575948F31F00000037562F74E5,0,The bad news: your princess is in another castle. The good news: she had time to work on her target shooting.
D6AA725759492351000016A3891D90F4,0,RASTER BLASTER
D6AA725759492351000016A4BA053B48,0,R.G.B. stands for Real Gnarly Beatdown when you whip out this pixelated panic-maker. Blow your enemy's bitmaps sky high!
D6AA725759492B4B000021E9A04AB90C,0,HOSTILE VOXEL
D6AA725759492B4B000021EAB1F92169,0,"The weapon that could put an end to the eternal dilemma: Which came first, the pixel or the voxel?"
C3C06483595E3F250000FC219D7405D4,0,Find me where your adventure began.
C3C06483595E3F400000FC24A05BA769,0,Find me where the Sunflower still stands.
