C3C06483596CDED3000002DCE239BCAB,0,S
D6AA7257596DBE31000000101C19FADB,0,CRANIAL ABROGATOR
D6AA7257596DBE3100000011886C5113,0,A steam powered hammer! What unnecessarily steam-powered inventions will they think of next? Juicer? Treadmill? Socks?
D6AA7257596DC2700000001C99EE43F8,0,EFFECTUAL ATOMIZER
D6AA7257596DC2700000001D01D1629A,0,Forget all the other steam-powered rockets (especially our last model - we're still being sued). The Atomizer is ACES!
D6AA7257596DF8F200000022044846E9,0,CALAMITOUS COUPE
D6AA7257596DF8F200000023D8DC7BB6,0,"Perfect for sentry duty or a joy ride to your favorite juke joint dance hall or ""Ivy League"" football game. 23 skidoo!"
D6AA7257596DC05E00000016334C7493,0,JEOPARDOUS JALOPY
D6AA7257596DC05E000000174D143B74,0,"Not only will this beauty keep you safe,  if there's a classic car show anywhere nearby you're bound to win first prize!"
D6AA7257596DF9AC000000281D38BA0D,0,BALEFUL BAD-ENDER
D6AA7257596DF9AC0000002908E68BDC,0,"Steampunk mech suits and stuff are cool, but they need a TON of maintenance. Trust us, you're better off with a hammer."
D6AA7257596DFA9B0000002EC4094DAF,0,DEFALCATING DANDY
D6AA7257596DFA9B0000002F4BC7DD77,0,"No worries about quality, we test every grenaduck before it leaves the factory floor. This one explodes great - trust us."
D6AA7257596DFAEB00000034AB57CE7A,0,EXALTED ENTROPIC EGGS
D6AA7257596DFAEB00000035378D224E,0,Faking a cockney accent when using this dapper explosive won't do more damage - but it REALLY adds to the atmosphere.
D6AA7257596DFB2C0000003A50EA8FC3,0,DIRELY DULCET DOOMSAYER
D6AA7257596DFB2C0000003B39CCACD2,0,"When not using this in combat, you can play old gramophone hits like ""Diane from Cheyenne"" or ""The Hobo Wedding Waltz""."
8925C81C596CD766000000114870E590,0,Pixel Pack
8925C81C596CD75B0000000F52618577,0,Your 8-bit pixelated prizes await you at Battle HQ!
8925C81C596DB6FD0000028928C63C86,0,The Pixel Pack is ready!
8925C81C596DB6FD0000028A8861D122,0,Start a retro riot with this set of 8-bit classic contrivances available right now at Battle HQ!
8925C81C596DB6D500000283FD38373B,0,PIXEL PACK UNLOCKED!
8925C81C596DB6D500000284818EE179,0,"Cool, vintage, pixelated! The Pixel Pack weapons are available for use!"
8925C81C596CE1B20000028380DA5CC7,0,Steampunk Pack
8925C81C596CE1B200000284F11D9299,0,Your vicious Victorian valuables await you at Battle HQ!
8925C81C596DB7510000028F0D631C6E,0,The Steampunk Pack is ready!
8925C81C596DB751000002908A524067,0,Serve up an elegant embroilment with this set of eight antique weapons available right now at Battle HQ!
8925C81C596DB77200000295C04EFA07,0,STEAMPUNK PACK UNLOCKED!
8925C81C596DB772000002964AD0C360,0,"Elegant, stylish and retro! The Steampunk Pack weapons are available for use!"
