CF956F1959E4A691000002CDF3C71893,0,Welcome to SUPERBRAWL: COMMUNITY EDITION!
CF956F1959E4A7640000031AFB73A629,0,Compete head-to-head with a 'friend' in Superbrawl and lead your team to victory!
CF956F1959E4A76D00000320283DB8C3,0,"No matter where you are with Story Mode, ALL heroes are UNLOCKED and AVAILABLE (just don't ask them for spoilers)."
CF956F1959E4A77400000326FE3F32FA,0,Heroes are pre-designed using Skill Sets that favor different specializations. Unlock more Skill Sets as you progress!
