8925C81C59E4CC00000000215C803BBA,0,"The key to a healthy active lifestyle is to keep moving - even in combat. Lots of pipes allow for cover and quick, easy access around the battlefield - for you AND your opponent."
8925C81C59E4CC000000002317CF7EC7,0,TRAMPOLINE ALLEY
8925C81C59E4CC00000000243098DE36,0,Those tired of jumping by committee are in luck - trampolines offer solo journeys to all corners of the map. Hint: Mover Booster allows for multiple bounces (great for your quads).
8925C81C59E4CC2C0000002C96322878,0,NOWHERE TO HIDE
8925C81C59E4CC2C0000002DFC01D361,0,"You can hide for a time, but eventually, everyone on this battlefield is left with their bloomers hanging in the breeze. Hint: the team atop 'Sneak Peak' has the advantage."
8925C81C59E4CC5000000033A2F698DC,0,MAKE HASTE SLOWLY
8925C81C59E4CC500000003414707CCC,0,"On this battlefield, haste makes waste and cover points aren't always the sanctuary they would seem to be. CAREFULLY consider each move before you advance."
