CF956F1959F88D00000107B9F69897AF,1,"Versus Mode allows for player vs. player combat using all heroes and skills available in the game. 
It's best enjoyed after you've played at least SOME of the story.
Have fun!"
CF956F1959F88D2E000107C1D56FE613,1,PLAY VERSUS MODE
CF956F195A09A5D600000A383566C794,0,UNLOCKED SKILL SETS
658CA41C5A140B350000000D6EA79EA1,0,"You got {0} {0?Power Orb,Power Orbs}"
658CA41C5A140B3C0000000EB3870ED6,0,Use them to upgrade your Heroes' Skill Tree at the Battle HQ! 
A75CF7E95A1BE37700010C922723DA58,0,WEAKEN
CF956F195A1C280900000351EBDE773C,0,{0} / {1}
42F5F6585A1E96B30001058F2E45CF60,0,"In a Reach Area battle, the objective is to have at least one Hero arrive as quickly as possible at the designated area."
42F5F6585A1E96C20001059237312AA3,0,"During an Escort battle, never allow your ward to remain out in the open - they should always be behind cover and well protected from danger."
42F5F6585A1E96C70001059598F579EB,0,"In a Reach Area battle, don't focus on defeating enemies - focus instead on moving as close as you safely can to the designated area with each turn."
42F5F6585A1E96CC0001059849A79465,0,The Honey Super Effect is tremendously effective during Reach Area battles. Use it to slow down pursuing enemies.
42F5F6585A1E96D40001059B784810B2,0,"During Escort battles, if the character you're escorting is low on health, try using a Hero as a decoy by leaving them exposed to the enemy."
42F5F6585A1E96D90001059ECC927B2A,0,You can use Coins to buy new weapons at Battle HQ. Most weapons have Super Effects that enhance their capabilities beyond the basic damage they do.
42F5F6585A1E96DF000105A15C705D25,0,"If one of your Heroes is low on health at the onset of a battle, swap them out for a Hero with more health BEFORE the battle starts."
42F5F6585A1E96E4000105A4D629D42A,0,"If a particular battle is giving you trouble, don't forget Extra Health Mode. Your Heroes will gain extra health without any penalty towards your performance evaluation."
42F5F6585A1E96EA000105A776E278D4,0,Check your Hero's skill tree often to see what upgrades you can spend Power Orbs on. It makes a huge difference to your Hero's performance in battle!
42F5F6585A1E96EE000105AA51088EF9,0,You can reset your Hero's Skill Tree anytime to get your Power Orbs back and try a different skill combination. Experiment all you want!
42F5F6585A1E96F3000105AD58C2F4A0,0,The Skill Tree can be Autofilled anytime without risk - if you're unhappy you can simply reset it to get your Power Orbs back and build it manually.
42F5F6585A1E96F8000105B0E3078BDF,0,Don't forget to experiment with different types of weapons for the Heroes in your lineup. Lots of effective synergies exist between team members using the right weapons.
42F5F6585A1E96FC000105B351D796B6,0,Dash enemies whenever possible - it's like having an extra attack!
42F5F6585A1E9701000105B61EC93754,0,Stay behind cover for full or partial protection from enemy fire.
42F5F6585A1E9707000105B9C5872AB1,0,Focus attacks on a single enemy to bring it down before targeting another.
42F5F6585A1E970C000105BC8B1ED284,0,Get to high ground using Team Jump or pipes and you'll cause extra damage when firing on enemies below.
42F5F6585A1E9713000105BF85A20672,0,Use the TactiCam to study your enemy's abilities and plan your strategy in advance.
42F5F6585A1E9718000105C2BA61CBD4,0,Escorted characters can't team jump - plan moves accordingly and don't leave them behind.
42F5F6585A1E971D000105C530385834,0,Enhanced mobility is a Hoppers' strongest skill. Have you tried stopping them with Honey?
42F5F6585A1E9721000105C849507F52,0,Hoppers make great targets when they jump. Reaction shots such as Mario's Hero Sight take excellent advantage of this opportunity.
42F5F6585A1E9726000105CB46B778E7,0,Take care of the Ziggies on high ground first and remember - explosive covers can be used to your advantage.
42F5F6585A1E972B000105CE4C38E4E3,0,The Chomp will attack the closest target on the battlefield. Make sure an enemy is closer to it than you are at the end of your turn.
42F5F6585A1E9730000105D1E065B27B,0,Shoot Smashers only when you are out of range of their Chase ability.
42F5F6585A1E9735000105D42F3C872F,0,Activate a reaction shot (such as Mario's Hero Sight) before attacking a Smasher in order to shoot them multiple times in a row.
42F5F6585A1E973B000105D7D9E38EDD,0,A Smasher will chase you only if you hit them with a weapon. Why not dash them instead?
42F5F6585A1E9740000105DA2F32F5F2,0,Place a Hero on the banana pressure plate in front of Rabbid Kong to make him vulnerable.
42F5F6585A1E9745000105DD69E078B5,0,Supporters should be your top priority as they can heal other enemies around them.
42F5F6585A1E974A000105E0C588B5AA,0,"Finding the double trouble of Blizzy and Sandy to be two too much? Focus on one of them first, then the other."
42F5F6585A1E974F000105E37D674B46,0,You can predict a Tornado's trajectory by looking at the weathercocks in the area.
42F5F6585A1E9755000105E686C5F791,0,A Bucklers' shield will block direct attacks. You'll need to outflank them to hit from either side or from behind.
42F5F6585A1E975A000105E9D9AD75F8,0,The Icicle Golem uses the fridge door as a shield. You'll need to outflank him.
42F5F6585A1E9760000105ECEB715B2F,0,Peek-a-Boos teleport when they move and won't trigger reaction shots. Adapt your strategy accordingly when battling against them.
42F5F6585A1E979F000105EF20EBDA69,0,Calavera has a shield to block attacks. You'll need to outflank him to attack from behind or from either side.
42F5F6585A1E97A4000105F2E01FDCCF,0,Boos can be distracted using Sentries.
42F5F6585A1E97A9000105F5366BE2ED,0,Dash the power supplies to the spotlights to make the Phantom vulnerable!
42F5F6585A1E97AF000105F8ABAC2FF9,0,Valkyries love to use Ground Pound near your Heroes. You may want to spread out when battling them.
42F5F6585A1E97B9000105FB79A018C1,0,"Pyroclasts will fall upon scorched terrain, only. Stay clear to stay safe."
42F5F6585A1E97BF000105FEA35D81DB,0,Bowser Jr. is especially dangerous when close to a Hero. Keep as far away as you can!
42F5F6585A1E97C40001060144EEC22E,0,"Before you focus on MegaDragonBowser, try dealing with the other enemies on the battlefield."
42F5F6585A1E97DE0001060D54F7B84C,0,Some enemies will take cover and will need to be outflanked if you're to get a clear shot at them.
42F5F6585A1E97E40001061041702FA4,0,Exposed enemies should be your first target.
42F5F6585A1E97F60001061CEE714316,0,"Heroes and their abilities (Movement, Attack, Technique) can be used in any order during your turn."
42F5F6585A1E97FB0001061FCA4826BC,0,"When enemies fall prey to Burn, Bounce and Push effects they can trigger your Heroes' reaction shots (such as Mario's Hero Sight). Prepare accordingly."
42F5F6585A1E9800000106225704E3DC,0,Luigi's or Rabbid Peach's Sentry makes for an excellent decoy target.
42F5F6585A1E980600010625A10F57FC,0,Cleansing Jump allows you to restore a Hero overcome by a Super Effect. Equip it in the Skill Tree!
42F5F6585A1E980A0001062820E72B67,0,While exploring you can access the Battle HQ to build your team's Skill Tree or buy weapons.
42F5F6585A1E98440001062BC55C8109,0,When Power Orbs are awarded they are allotted to EACH hero to spend on their individual skill trees.
42F5F6585A1E984A0001062E503A428D,0,"At Battle HQ you can change your team's lineup, upgrade your Heroes' abilities and buy weapons you've unlocked during your adventures."
42F5F6585A1E98510001063150C936A0,0,You can find info and statistics for any Hero on your team at Battle HQ.
42F5F6585A1E98560001063411C75795,0,Play exclusive co-op battles with a friend at the Buddydome Rabbolatory!
42F5F6585A1E985B0001063754C05CB1,0,Pay attention! Some midbosses and bosses are immune to particular Techniques or Super Effects.
42F5F6585A1E98610001063A77A095F5,0,Enemies get stronger as you go. Upgrade weapons often to keep up!
42F5F6585A1E98650001063D250C4DB6,0,Use the TactiCam to get more info on your enemies before a battle. Just move the cursor over the enemy you want to know more about.
42F5F6585A1E986A0001064071C9A67F,0,Area of Damage weapons will affect enemies even if they're behind cover.
42F5F6585A1E986E000106435ABED382,0,While using the TactiCam you can hover the cursor over Rabbid Ears in the ground to discover what kind of enemy is about to spawn.
42F5F6585A1E9873000106466A5371B6,0,Sentries will trigger enemy reaction shots so you can move freely.
42F5F6585A1E987800010649896E9A6B,0,"When replaying a Chapter, you will need to earn a bigger trophy to have a new personal best recorded by the Washing Machine."
42F5F6585A1E987D0001064C0FD3B742,0,You can always replay Chapters using the Washing Machine to beat your personal best.
42F5F6585A1E98820001064F0A27C109,0,When replaying a Chapter via the Washing Machine you will keep your current rank - though enemies will have the same rank they had during the original playthrough.
42F5F6585A1E9889000106524B889E5B,0,When replaying a Chapter via the Washing Machine you can only use the contextual actions you had available to you when you first played the Chapter.
42F5F6585A1E988D00010655AFBE122A,0,Use the Washing Machine Rabbolatory to jump back in time and beat your personal best on previously completed Chapters.
42F5F6585A1E98920001065857ADFE43,0,Did you know that there is a Secret Chapter in each World? You can use the World Cannons at Peach's Castle to go back and find them. Each Secret Chapter has lots of useful rewards.
42F5F6585A1E98970001065B2D5EDBCA,0,Successfully completing Challenges awards you with Power Orbs to spend on your Heroes' Skill Trees.
42F5F6585A1E989C0001065E8D32C795,0,Peach's Protect Technique is especially helpful in keeping escorted characters safe during Escort Battles.
42F5F6585A1E989F0001066109010941,0,The Freeze and Stone Super Effects dispel your activated Techniques such as reaction shots or Protect.
42F5F6585A1E98A600010664068BDBFC,0,Rabbid Yoshi’s Scaredy Rabbid will trigger other Heroes’ reaction shots.
42F5F6585A1E98AC00010667C9FE5308,0,"Yoshi's Ground Pound is highly effective - just beware that it will damage enemies AND Heroes, alike. Use it carefully!"
42F5F6585A1E98B00001066A6FABFA33,0,Rabbid Yoshi can dash multiple times during a single Movement action.
42F5F6585A1E98B40001066D52BC3F9D,0,"Now that you've defeated MegaDragonBowser, there are four Ultimate Challenges awaiting you at Peach's Castle. Good luck!"
42F5F6585A1E98C3000106708956507A,0,Prioritize keeping Heroes alive - even a Hero with low health can deal out a lot of damage!
42F5F6585A1E98C800010673DE763554,0,Luigi's Itchy Feet Technique allows him to go a lot farther during his Movement action.
42F5F6585A1E98CC000106767D08C962,0,When using the TactiCam you can lock on an enemy to see its  complete range of actions.
42F5F6585A1E98D1000106790EDB8016,0,"Whenever a character is under the Vamp Super Effect, all damage dealt to it during the turn is given to the attacker as a health bonus."
42F5F6585A1E98D60001067C3A1BEFA1,0,Mario's Stomp Jump damages enemies and increases his mobility.
42F5F6585A1E98DB0001067F4C6AC855,0,Luigi's Double Jump gives him improved mobility and makes him the perfect candidate for Reach Area battles.
42F5F6585A1E98E1000106822A495A79,0,Rabbid Luigi's Vamp Dash drains health from foes.
42F5F6585A1E98E600010685E9004354,0,Rabbid Peach can dash twice in the same Movement action - more if you upgrade her Skill Tree!
42F5F6585A1E98EA0001068818BCCFE8,0,Go to the amiibo Rabbolatory to unlock new weapons using your amiibo.
42F5F6585A1E98F00001068B44B9B8EA,0,"Did you check the Museum Rabbolatory? It's packed with all the Artwork, 3D Models and Soundtracks you found during your adventures!"
42F5F6585A1E98F40001068E4E973633,0,"If your enemy is behind cover, try to outflank them for a clear shot or use a secondary weapon to damage them."
42F5F6585A1E98FB00010691B14001DC,0,You can replay a Chapter anytime you want using the Washing Machine to relive your glory days!
42F5F6585A1E98FE0001069411B9786E,0,There are 10 Challenges awaiting you in each World you complete - look for the Rabbids wearing big hats and waving a flag.
42F5F6585A1E9903000106970EB10326,0,You can use newly unlocked contextual actions to access new areas when revisiting Worlds you have already completed.
42F5F6585A1E99080001069A1B3396F6,0,The Lift contextual action will allow you to discover new areas.
42F5F6585A1E990C0001069DD338F4F5,0,Rabbid Mario can combine his Magnet Dance Technique and melee Attack to great effect.
42F5F6585A1E9910000106A059CB51FA,0,Supporters should be your top priority as they can heal nearby foes. The Freeze Technique also prevents them from using Heal.
42F5F6585A1E9914000106A3DAE2D8F1,0,Freeze an enemy to cancel its reaction shot.
42F5F6585A1E9918000106A6EF2101E4,0,Boomshot and secondary weapons can hit multiple enemies with a single shot - just beware any friendly fire!
42F5F6585A1E991D000106A9789D98FB,0,Peach's Healing Jump heals Heroes who are close by when she lands.
42F5F6585A1E9922000106AC7FDE17C1,0,Rabbid Mario's Boom Dash deals explosive damage to the area around his target.
42F5F6585A1E9926000106AFA403FE79,0,"Failed a Red Coin challenge? You can restart them immediately, anytime."
42F5F6585A1E992B000106B263CF7375,0,"Hit by hit, most covers are eventually destroyed - crumbling to nothing or triggering a Super Effect."
